var CONTENT = {"anua-bha-2-gentle-exfoliating-toner-150ml":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Anua BHA 2% Gentle Exfoliating Toner 150ml – Clearer, Smoother Skin Starts Here</strong></p>\n<p>Achieve a fresh, refined complexion with <strong>Anua BHA 2% Gentle Exfoliating Toner</strong>, a lightweight yet powerful formula designed to unclog pores, control oil, and smooth skin texture. Infused with <strong>2% salicylic acid</strong>, this toner gently exfoliates to reduce breakouts and congestion while <strong>tea tree extract</strong> calms irritation and redness.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Deep Pore Cleansing:</strong> BHA removes excess oil and dead skin cells, preventing breakouts.<br><strong>Soothing &amp; Hydrating:</strong> Tea tree extract calms inflammation, while six ceramides strengthen the skin barrier.<br><strong>Lightweight &amp; Non-Irritating:</strong> Absorbs quickly, leaving skin refreshed without stripping moisture.</p>\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Acne-Prone &amp; Oily Skin</strong></h3>\n<p>Fragrance-free and dermatologist-tested, this <strong>gentle yet effective exfoliating toner</strong> helps you achieve balanced, healthy-looking skin. Use it daily for a visibly smoother, more refined glow</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","anua-heartleaf-77-soothing-toner":"<h2>ANUA Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner</h2>\n<h3>Comprehensive Skin Care</h3>\n<p>The ANUA Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is designed to tone, moisturize, soothe, and balance your skin. Enriched with 77% heartleaf extract, it provides anti-inflammatory and calming effects. Its lightweight texture ensures light hydration, leaving your skin even, moisturized, and clear. Ideal for sensitive skin, this toner is free from irritating ingredients.</p>\n<h3>Key Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Multi-Action:</strong> Tones, moisturizes, soothes, and balances the skin.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Calming Effect:</strong> Heartleaf extract offers anti-inflammatory and calming properties.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight Hydration:</strong> Ensures your skin stays hydrated without feeling heavy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sensitive Skin Friendly:</strong> Free from irritating ingredients, perfect for all skin types.</li>\n</ul>\n<!---->","anua-heartleaf-pore-control-cleansing-oil":"<p><span>ANUA Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil, with its gentle active ingredients, effectively removes blackheads, makeup, and excess sebum without clogging pores. The heartleaf extract in the formula helps soothe skin irritations and is suitable for acne-prone and sensitive skin.</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<strong>SIZE</strong> : 200ml / 6.76 fl. oz</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<p>Apply the product to dry skin, add some water, and massage until the oil transforms into an emulsion. Then rinse with water.</p>\n\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butyl Avocadate, Fragrance, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Tocopherol, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Melia Azadirachta Bark Extract, Moringa Oleifera Seed Oil, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract.</p>","anua-heartleaf-quercetinol-pore-deep-cleansing-foam":"<p><strong>Anua Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam 150ml – Purify &amp; Soothe in One Step</strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Reveal a clearer, more balanced complexion with <strong>Anua Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam</strong>. This gentle yet powerful cleanser is formulated with <strong>Anti-Sebum P and salicylic acid</strong> to effectively unclog pores, remove excess oil, and clear away impurities without stripping your skin’s natural moisture.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Deep Pore Cleansing:</strong> Heartleaf powder (3,000ppm) works to purify and exfoliate, leaving skin refreshed.<br><strong>Balanced Hydration:</strong> Glycerin and a complex of hyaluronic acids help maintain moisture while cleansing.<br><strong>Calming &amp; Soothing:</strong> Quercetin and heartleaf extract soothe inflammation and support a healthy skin barrier.</p>\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Oily, Combination &amp; Sensitive Skin</strong></h3>\n<p>Designed to target blackheads, breakouts, and excess sebum, <strong>Anua Heartleaf Cleansing Foam</strong> delivers a deep cleanse while keeping your skin calm and hydrated. Use it daily for a fresh, clear, and balanced glow</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","anua-niacinamide-10-txa-4-serum":"<p><strong>Radiance-Boosting Serum with 10% Niacinamide &amp; 4% TXA – Clarity &amp; Balance in Every Drop</strong></p>\n<p>Unveil a brighter, more even complexion with this lightweight, non-greasy serum, expertly formulated with <strong>10% Niacinamide</strong> and <strong>4% Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</strong>. Designed to improve skin clarity, hydration, and balance, this serum helps soothe irritation while enhancing your skin’s natural glow.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Brightens &amp; Evens Skin Tone:</strong> Niacinamide works to reduce dullness and discoloration.</p>\n<p> <strong>Hydrating &amp; Gentle:</strong> A lightweight, watery texture absorbs quickly without leaving residue.</p>\n<p> <strong>Perfect for All Skin Types:</strong> Suitable for acne-prone, sensitive, and combination skin.</p>\n<h3><strong>Results You Can Feel</strong></h3>\n<p>Dermatologist-tested for <strong>low irritation</strong>, this serum is your go-to for a <strong>clearer, healthier-looking complexion</strong>—without the heaviness. Apply daily for a fresh, luminous glow.</p>","body-builder":"<p><strong>WEIGHTLESS VOLUMISING MOUSSE</strong></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weightless, volumising spray mousse</li>\n<li>Created with ‘memory hold’ resins</li>\n<li>Provides silky hold and shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free </li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><strong>SHAKE. SPRAY. REPEAT</strong><span>. Apply </span><strong>BODY.BUILDER</strong><span> to damp hair and dry in for long lasting body.</span></p>\n\n<!---->","byredo-blanche-50ml":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Byredo Blanche Eau de Parfum 50ml – Pure Elegance in a Bottle</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the essence of sophistication with Byredo Blanche, a fragrance that captures the beauty of simplicity and the allure of purity. Inspired by the color white, this scent reflects clean lines, fresh beginnings, and timeless grace.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>A Refreshing Start:</strong> Uplifting top notes of aldehydes, pink pepper, and white rose offer a sparkling opening.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Delicate Florals:</strong> A heart of peony, neroli, and violet adds a soft, floral charm that feels effortlessly elegant.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lasting Warmth:</strong> Base notes of musk, sandalwood, and blonde woods leave a smooth, comforting finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Every Occasion</strong></h3>\n<p>Whether you're attending a formal event or enjoying a casual day out, Byredo Blanche complements your style with understated luxury. Its clean and crisp profile is ideal for those who prefer a subtle yet memorable signature scent.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","captain-fawcett-beard-oil-cf-332-private-stock":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>PRIVATE STOCK BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT</strong><br>Delectable blend of fragrant essential oils fused with Sweet Almond, Jojoba &amp; Vitamin E base oils. Daily use of these elegantly balanced Cedarwood, Black Pepper, Patchouli &amp; Palmarosa oils will soothe, moisturise and invigorate both skin &amp; facial hair.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>moisturizes, doesn't dry out the skin</span></li>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>smooths the beard and reduces frizziness</span></li>\n<li><span>softens the beard</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Dispense a few drops of Fawcett’s finest Beard Oil onto the palm of your hand &amp; smooth into your Beard. Gently comb through for a tip top finish.</p>","christian-dior-homme-intense-eau-de-parfum-50ml":"<p><strong>Christian Dior Homme Intense Eau de Parfum 50ml – Refined Elegance &amp; Sensual Allure</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the world of sophisticated masculinity with <strong>Dior Homme Intense</strong>, a luxurious fragrance that blends elegance, strength, and sensuality. This noble woody-floral perfume is designed for confident men who appreciate style and individuality.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Composition:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> Lavender adds a touch of freshness and aristocratic refinement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Iris, combined with amber-infused musk, creates depth and sensuality.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Vetiver and cedarwood form a warm, woody trail with a sophisticated, noble character.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love Dior Homme Intense?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li> <strong>Long-lasting &amp; memorable</strong> – a rich composition that stays vibrant throughout the day.<br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Elegant design</strong> – a sleek and stylish bottle reflecting Dior’s understated luxury.<br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect for special occasions</strong> – ideal for evenings, important meetings, and moments when you want to stand out.</li>\n<li> <strong>Warm, noble trail</strong> – a fragrance that leaves a lasting impression.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody-Oriental</p>\n<p>Enhance your charisma and style with <strong>Dior Homme Intense Eau de Parfum</strong> – the choice for those who appreciate true elegance.</p>","cosrx-advanced-snail-92-all-in-one-cream":"<p>COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream is a moisturizing cream with a unique jelly texture. It consists of 92% Snail Secretion filtrate with soothing, healing, and calming properties. Delivers a boost of hydration that feels light and fresh due to the jelly texture. For best results, combine with the COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence.Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive, and acne-prone skin</p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS </strong></p>\n<p><span>• Cosrx Advanced Snail 92 All in One Cream is a versatile solution that hydrates, revitalizes, and heals all skin types.</span></p>\n<p><span>• It’s especially effective for complexions prone to acne or showing signs of aging and breakouts.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>HOW TO USE</strong> </span></p>\n<p><span>After your regular cleanse and tone routine, gently apply the cream on your face, being cautious around the eyes and mouth. Pat any remaining product into your skin using your fingertips to facilitate better absorption.</span></p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>Snail Secretion Filtrate, Betaine, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Stearic acid, Arginine, Dimethicone, Carbomer, Panthenol, Allantoin, Sodium Polyacrylate, Xanthan Gum, Ethyl Hexanediol, Adenosine, Phenoxyethanol.</p>\n<!---->","cosrx-advanced-snail-96-mucin-power-essence":"<p><span>Enriched with 96.3% skin-boosting ingredient snail secretion filtrate. Light-weight essence which absorbs into skin fast to give skin natural glow from the inside. This essence is created from nutritious, low-stimulation filtered snail mucin to keep your skin moisturized and illuminated all day.</span></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fades dark spots</li>\n<li>Improves skin texture</li>\n<li>Anti-aging</li>\n<li>Intense hydration</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<p>After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount on your entire face. Gently pat using fingertips to aid absorption, and then go forth with your moisturizer.</p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>Snail Secretion Filtrate, Betaine, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethyl Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Carbomer, Panthenol, Arginine, Aqua/Water</p>\n<!---->","cosrx-aha-bha-clarifying-treatment-toner":"<p><span>Infused with AHA, BHA, and natural botanical extracts, the AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner is designed to calm, refresh, and soften the skin. Its unique formula combines AHA and BHA acids with plant-based ingredients to refine skin texture, boost radiance, and minimize the appearance of pores. This all-in-one product cleanses, exfoliates, and hydrates simultaneously. With 10% white willow bark extract and 10% apple water, it effectively soothes irritation. The toner gently exfoliates while panthenol and allantoin deeply moisturize and provide a comforting feel to the skin.</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<strong>SIZE</strong> : 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz  </span></p>\n<p><strong><u>BENEFITS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Exfoliate surface of skin<br>• Smooths and softens<br>• Clear congested pores<br>• Balance oil production</p>\n<p><strong><u>TARGETS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Beginners to chemical exfoliation<br>• Gentle, soft exfoliation<br>• Daily use<br>• All skin types including Sensitive Skin</p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<p>After cleansing your skin, spray the toner onto a cotton pad and softly sweep it across your face, steering clear of the eye and lip areas. If applying during the daytime, ensure you finish with a broad-spectrum sunscreen with an SPF of 30 or higher.</p>\n<div>\n<section>\n<div><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Water, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Lactate, Glycolic Acid, Betaine Salicylate, Allantoin, Panthenol, Ethyl Hexanediol</div>\n</section>\n</div>","cosrx-full-fit-propolis-synergy-toner":"<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>An anhydrous toner that helps tone and soften the skin, containing 72.6% resin extract and 10% honey extract. It provides intense soothing effects while nourishing and strengthening the skin’s protective barrier. The toner has an essence-like texture that absorbs quickly, feels lightweight, and doesn’t leave any sticky residue. This \"booster\" toner activates skin regeneration processes, effectively soothes irritation, enhances skin resilience, restores damaged areas, balances pH levels, and nourishes the skin. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and problem skin.</span></p>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<strong>SIZE</strong> : 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><u>BENEFITS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Nourish for healthy skin<br>• Plump, glowing skin<br>• Reduce redness<br>• Improve skin texture</p>\n<p><span><br></span></p>\n<p><strong><u>TARGETS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Dull, dehydrated skin<br>• Red, irritated skin<br><em>• </em>Great for all skin types and seasons</p>\n\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<p>Apply the product as the first step in your skincare routine immediately after cleansing your face. Gently massage it onto your entire face for better absorption.</p>","cosrx-low-ph-good-morning-gel-cleanser":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>A gentle cleansing gel with a low pH level and a light acidic formula. This gel is perfect for daily use in the morning and evening, effectively removing impurities while strengthening the skin's protective barrier. It cleanses without drying and simultaneously enhances skin texture. Suitable for all skin types, it helps you wake up with firmer and fresher skin, maintaining its cleanliness throughout the night. The formula, with an optimal pH level, includes tea tree oil and BHA acids to soothe and fortify the skin, leaving it clear and naturally radiant</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><strong>SIZE</strong><span> : 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz </span> </p>\n<p><strong><u>BENEFITS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Hydrating cleanse without stripping<br>• Removes impurities<br>• Protects skin barrier<br>• Restores pH Balance</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong><u>TARGETS</u></strong></p>\n<p>• Dry skin<br>• Dull &amp; tired skin<br>• Uneven skin texture<br><em>* Great for sensitive skin</em></p>\n\n<p><strong><em>HOW TO USE </em></strong></p>\n<p><em>Use the product morning and night after removing makeup. Wet your face and hands. Dispense an appropriate amount into your palm and lather. Gently massage onto your face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.</em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","creed-aventus-eau-de-parfum-for-men-50ml":"<p>Creed Aventus is a legendary fragrance crafted for the modern man who exudes confidence, ambition, and timeless elegance. Inspired by the triumphant lives of emperors and bold leaders, this perfume is a statement of individuality and success.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Notes:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> A refreshing burst of pineapple, blackcurrant, apple, and bergamot energizes your senses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> The richness of birch, rose, and patchouli adds depth and refinement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> A warm blend of musk, oakmoss, vanilla, and amber creates a lasting impression.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why Choose Creed Aventus?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unparalleled Quality:</strong> Crafted with premium ingredients for a luxurious olfactory experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Signature Design:</strong> The sleek, sophisticated bottle mirrors the elegance of the fragrance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Appeal:</strong> Perfect for any season or occasion, from boardrooms to black-tie events.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Who is Creed Aventus For?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Men seeking a signature scent that complements their ambitious lifestyle.</li>\n<li>Those who value timeless, bold fragrances with a modern twist.</li>\n<li>Individuals who want to leave a lasting impression wherever they go.</li>\n</ul>","creed-creed-aventus-cologne-50ml":"<p><strong>Creed Aventus Cologne Eau de Parfum – Vibrant and Refined. Unmistakably Modern</strong></p>\n<p>Step into a world where tradition meets bold innovation. <em>Creed Aventus Cologne</em> is a masterful reinterpretation of classic cologne, blending crisp citrus freshness with the depth of a modern eau de parfum. Crafted by Olivier Creed, this unisex fragrance is a radiant tribute to confidence, vitality, and timeless style!</p>\n<p><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong> Sparkling tangerine, zesty ginger, and a dash of pink pepper ignite the senses with a burst of aromatic freshness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong> The warmth of patchouli, creamy sandalwood, and earthy vetiver form a sophisticated and grounding core.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong> A bold foundation of styrax, smoky birch, sensual musk, and smooth tonka bean adds lasting depth and allure.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Unisex Brilliance:</strong> Designed for those who appreciate bold, versatile scents that transcend gender.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Signature Creed Quality:</strong> Created by the legendary House of Creed with meticulous attention to detail and excellence.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Modern Elegance:</strong> A cologne-inspired scent with the strength and longevity of an EDP—perfect for day-to-evening wear.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Timeless Appeal:</strong> Aventus Cologne is more than a fragrance—it's a statement of ambition, sophistication, and effortless charisma.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","davines-hair-beard-body-wash":"<p><strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE HAIR, BEARD &amp; BODY WASH BY DAVINES</strong><br> Men's multi-purpose cleansing product formulated to wash hair, beard and body. It is enriched with Alkekenghi, rich in antioxidants and contributes to promote a delicate cleansing with a distinctive citrusy scent. Provides hydration leaving the skin soft. Suitable also to cleanse the beard and moustache prior to shaving.</p>\n<p><b>BENEFITS:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently and effectively cleanses hair, body and beard</li>\n<li>Provides hydration and leaves skin soft</li>\n<li>Clean and distinctive fragrance, leaving the skin gently scented</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply to wet hair, beard and body. Gently massage. Rinse thoroughly. Rinse thoroughly in case of contact with eyes.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","davines-medium-hold-styling-paste":"<p><strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE MEDIUM HOLD STYLING PASTE BY DAVINES<br></strong>Workable styling paste for flexible and versatile styles. Gives a textured effect and medium hold, ideal for a controlled look with a natural finish. Maintains natural shine and movement, without sticky residue.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For flexible and versatile styles</li>\n<li>Gives a natural finish</li>\n<li>Promotes textured effects with medium hold</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Work a small quantity between the hands, apply to dry hair and style. For a lighter effect, apply to damp hair and proceed with styling.</span><br>\n<p><strong><br></strong></p>","davines-non-foaming-transparent-shaving-gel":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE NON-FOAMING TRANSPARENT SHAVING GEL BY DAVINES<br></strong>Non foaming shaving gel, can be used to shave the full beard, or as a precision finishing step for details around the beard. Designed with a transparent texture, it allows to shave precision lines with the razor in the beard and contour mustaches.<br><strong>BENEFITS:<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Transparent gel texture for precise shaves</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Leaves the skin soft and fresh</span>\n</li>\n<li><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Delicate on the skin</span></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Using fingertips, apply the product on the area to be shaved. Shave as desired. Remove with a damp towel and apply aftershave.</span><br>","davines-pasta-love-strong-hold-mat-clay":"<strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE STRONG HOLD MAT CLAY BY DAVINES<br></strong>This matte hair clay adds texture, definition and a strong durable hold. It adds body, thickness, and structure to the hair leaving no residue.<br><b>BENEFITS:<br></b>\n<ul>\n<li>matte effect</li>\n<li>a<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<span>dds texture and definition</span>\n</li>\n<li>s<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<span>trong durable hold</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Work a small quantity of product in the hands then apply to dry hair and sculpt as desired.</span><br>","davines-pre-shaving-beard-oil":"<strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE PRE-SHAVING &amp; BEARD OIL BY DAVINES<br></strong>Luxurious moisturizing oil, ideal for prepping before shaving or adding shape and softness to dry beards, with Almond and Jojoba oils.<br><strong>BENEFITS:<br></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>double use: pre-shaving and for the beard</li>\n<li>hydrating, softening and soothing action<br>\n</li>\n<li>it gives extra protection<br>\n</li>\n<li>it does not leave residue or weigh beard down<br>\n</li>\n<li>with jojoba, almond and abyssinian crambe oil<br>\n</li>\n<li>enriched with organic cutleaf groundcherry extract<br>\n</li>\n<li>vibrant citrus fragrance</li>\n<li>97,8% from natural origin</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>As a pre-shave; apply evenly on face and neck then follow with softening shaving gel.</span><br><span>As a beard moisturizer: apply a few drops of product on palms and spread evenly on the beard.</span><br>","davines-softening-shaving-gel":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>PASTA&amp;LOVE SOFTENING SHAVING GEL BY DAVINES<br></strong>Gel-to-foam formula for a fast, close and gentle shave, enriched with Alkekengi extract for its soothing properties.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>it makes shaving easier</span></li>\n<li>soft and pleasantly scented skin</li>\n<li>formulated with gentle surfactants</li>\n<li>enriched with organic cutleaf groundcherry extract</li>\n<li>vibrant citrus fragrance</li>\n<li>85,8% from natural origin</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Dispense gel onto palms and distribute the foam on damped face and neck in an even layer using circular movements, then shave. rinse thoroughly in case of contact with eyes.</span><br>","deep-cut-t-shirt-with-an-extended-back":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>\"King Of The Ink\" UNISEX deep V-neck slim T-shirt with an extended back </strong><br></p>\n<p><span>Made of high-quality materials that ensure comfort and allow the skin to breathe.</span><br><br><span>The fabric contains elastane, which is stretchy and fits the figure. The material is wear-resistant and does not lose its shape after repeated washing. Does not fade over time.</span><br><br><strong>Print:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hypoallergenic paint</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for washing in the washing machine. It is recommended to use the delicate wash (hand wash) mode.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Composition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Cotton 98%</span></li>\n<li><span>Spandex 2%</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Care guide:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hand wash/machine wash up to 30°C</span></li>\n<li><span>The maximum ironing temperature is 110°C</span></li>\n<li><span>Do not bleach</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for dry cleaning</span></li>\n<li><span>Drying on a horizontal surface in a straightened state</span></li>\n<li><span>Tumble drying is prohibited</span></li>\n</ul>","easy-rider":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>DEFINING ANTI FRIZZ CRÈME <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Take it easy, and treat your hair as you style with EASY.RIDER, our defining anti frizz crème designed to de-frizz and activate curl. Full of antioxidants and minerals, it provides the nourishment of a treatment as it delivers smoother, sleeker styles with flexible hold.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Controls frizz and activates curl</li>\n<li>Provides flexible hold</li>\n<li>Helps thicken fine hair, and soften thick hair</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. TREAT. STYLE.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply </span>EASY.RIDER to damp or dry hair.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","free-hold":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<strong>FLEXIBLE MEDIUM HOLD STYLING PASTE <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Feel FREE to create as much HOLD as you like with FREE.HOLD our medium-hold styling paste. FREE.HOLD imparts natural shine and delivers flexible hold with a boost of antioxidant and essential oil goodness, it also helps leave the hair feeling nourished and conditioned.<br><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides flexible, medium hold</li>\n<li>Adds natural-looking shine</li>\n<li>Creates a thickening effect within the hair</li>\n<li>Lubricates the hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Delivers a glossy finish</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>APPLY. TREAT. STYLE.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apply </span>FREE.HOLD <span>to damp or dry hair.</span><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>","gatsby-moving-rubber-grunge-mat-grey-hair-wax":"<p>Grunge Mat is perfect for creating a matte hairstyle without shine, suitable for hair lengths ranging from very short to medium.</p>\n<p><br><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contains the latest \"smooth polymer\" that provides lightness and leaves no stickiness.</li>\n<li>Includes Moving Rubber that offers strong hold and allows for easy restyling at any time.</li>\n<li>Recommended hair length: very short, short, and medium-short.</li>\n<li>Paraben-free.</li>\n<li>Refreshing green apple fragrance.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apply a small amount to your palm. Evenly distribute it with your hands and apply to your hair, focusing on the ends.</li>\n<li>Distribute evenly throughout the hair, starting from the roots, and gently lift the ends with your fingertips.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I<strong>NGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p> Water, Euphorbia Cerifera Wax, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Paraffin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Ceteth-20, Mineral Oil, Microcrystalline Wax, Sorbitan Stearate, Butylene Glycol, Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Stearyl Alcohol, PPG-10, Sorbitol, Triethanolamine, Caprylyl Glycol, Dimethicone, Carbomer, Fragrance, PEG-90M, Panthenol, Polyquaternium-11, Red 33(CI 7200).</p>\n<p><strong>PRECAUTIONS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse immediately with water.</li>\n<li>Discontinue use if redness, rash, or itching occurs. If irritation persists, consult a physician.</li>\n<li>Keep out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest. In case of ingestion, seek medical attention.</li>\n<li>Store at room temperature.</li>\n</ul>","gatsby-moving-rubber-wild-shake-15g":"<h3>Effortlessly Messy Style</h3>\n<p>Achieve a casual, messed-up look with GATSBY Moving Rubber Wild Shake. Made in Japan, this styling product helps you create dynamic movement and texture for an effortlessly cool hairstyle.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Casual Style:</strong> Formulated to create a casual, tousled look with ease.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Dynamic Movement:</strong> Provides flexibility and texture for hair that moves naturally.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Application:</strong> Simply take a small quantity onto your palm, spread it out well, and blend into the ends or other parts of your hair for desired movement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Use:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Take a small quantity onto palm and spread out well.</li>\n<li>Blend into ends or other parts of hair where you want to create movement.</li>\n<li>Spread out thinly on the surface of hair by drawing round circles with palm.</li>\n<li>Split hair bundles around, pinching them lightly.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Ingredients:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Newly Developed Smooth Polymer</li>\n<li>Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax</li>\n<li>Microcrystalline Wax</li>\n</ul>\n<!---->","guerlain-aqua-allegoria-forte-bosca-vanilla-edp-125ml":"<p><strong>Guerlain Aqua Allegoria Forte Bosca Vanilla Eau de Parfum</strong><br><strong>Fresh. Warm. Irresistibly Refined.</strong></p>\n<p>Discover a fragrance where nature’s vibrant energy meets comforting sensuality. <em>Bosca Vanilla</em> from Guerlain’s Aqua Allegoria Forte collection is a bold olfactory journey—balancing sparkling citrus with golden warmth and creamy depth</p>\n<p><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>Zesty <strong>bergamot</strong> and invigorating <strong>eucalyptus</strong> burst forth with crisp brightness, awakening the senses with pure vitality.</p>\n<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>A radiant blend of <strong>immortelle</strong> and <strong>sunny floral notes</strong> blooms at the center, casting a golden glow of warmth and serenity.</p>\n<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>Smooth <strong>vanilla</strong>, <strong>moist woods</strong>, and a whisper of <strong>musk</strong> create a lasting embrace—soft, sensual, and slightly mysterious.</p>\n<p><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Unisex Elegance:</strong> Designed for anyone drawn to fresh yet warmly enveloping scents</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Naturally Inspired:</strong> A harmonious expression of the wild and refined</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Signature Trail:</strong> Lingers delicately, leaving an aura of comfort and sophistication</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Made in France:</strong> From the legendary house of Guerlain</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Olfactory Family:</strong> Citrus · Woody · Gourmand · Aromatic<br><strong>Concentration:</strong> Eau de Parfum<br><strong>Size:</strong> 125ml</p>\n<p>Let yourself be guided by the balance of light and depth—<em>Bosca Vanilla</em> is a scent that embraces you like golden sunlight on cool forest air.</p>","guerlain-habit-rouge-eau-de-parfum-100ml":"<p><strong>Guerlain Habit Rouge Eau de Parfum</strong><br><strong>Timeless. Bold. Distinctly French.</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the legacy of refined masculinity with <em>Habit Rouge</em>, a masterfully crafted Eau de Parfum by Guerlain. This modern take on the iconic 1965 classic fuses fiery elegance with deep sensuality—an ode to confidence, passion, and unmistakable French charm.</p>\n<p><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>A sophisticated blend of <strong>neroli</strong> and <strong>jasmine</strong> brings a bright, spicy floral core that radiates warmth and vitality.</p>\n<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>Luxurious <strong>leather</strong> and rare <strong>oud</strong> offer depth and complexity, while <strong>vanilla</strong> and <strong>patchouli</strong> provide a smooth, sensual finish that lingers like a signature.</p>\n<p><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Amber-Woody Character:</strong> Rich and opulent, with an unmistakable masculine edge</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Heritage Meets Modernity:</strong> A bold evolution of Guerlain’s legendary 1965 scent</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>French Elegance:</strong> Designed for the man who commands attention with understated sophistication</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Lasting Impression:</strong> Deep, warm base notes ensure a powerful and memorable trail</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Olfactory Family:</strong> Oriental · Woody<br><strong>Size:</strong> 100m<br></p>","gummy-sheet-mask-madecassoside-sticker":"<h2>Abib Gummy Sheet Mask Madecassoside Sticker</h2>\n<h3>Intense Hydration and Soothing Care</h3>\n<p>Experience the powerful soothing and anti-inflammatory benefits of the Abib Gummy Sheet Mask Madecassoside Sticker. Infused with Madecassoside, a potent derivative of Centella Asiatica, this mask supports collagen production, promoting flexible and firm skin. The addition of Allantoin aids in skin regeneration, while Arginine delivers anti-wrinkle effects for a unified, radiant complexion.</p>\n<h3>Key Benefits:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soothing and Healing:</strong> Madecassoside and Centella Asiatica reduce inflammation and redness, effectively healing scars and acne.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Skin Renewal:</strong> Allantoin stimulates new skin cell formation, soothing irritation and protecting against external stressors.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-Wrinkle Effects:</strong> Arginine minimizes fine lines and wrinkles, restoring hydration and preventing moisture loss.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Deep Hydration:</strong> The highly moisturizing ingredients penetrate deep into the skin, ensuring lasting hydration and a protective moisture barrier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Advanced Microfiber Technology:</strong> Ensures 100% essence penetration and adapts to every face shape, providing a snug fit and prolonged moisture.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Use:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Apply to cleansed and toned skin.</li>\n<li>Leave on for 15 minutes.</li>\n<li>Remove the mask and continue with your skincare routine.</li>\n</ol>\n<!---->","hair-resort-spray":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 17\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 19\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 22\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 23\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 24\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 25\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 27\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 28\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 30\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 31\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 32\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 33\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 35\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 38\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><em>BEACH LOOK</em> TEXTURE SPRAY <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Give yourself a \"day at the beach hairstyle\" with this aromatic volume and  </span><em><span>beach look hair spray. </span></em><span>Honey, citrus and mandarin extract help create a sexy, tousled surfer look. This product offers X-HP™ heat protection, protecting hair from heat up to 220°C (428°F).</span></p>\n<div title=\"Page 53\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 10\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 16\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 21\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 29\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 36\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>KEVIN.MURPHY's TEXTURE line, with honey and citrus oils, volumizes hair and adds texture, resulting in infinitely bouncy, \"day-old\" beachy hair.</span></p>\n<p><em><span>Surf's up</span></em><span>  - the waves await... Then let your hair enjoy a day at the beach with HAIR.RESORT.SPRAY, which helps create Kevin Murphy's iconic, sexy beach curls. Refreshing bursts of citrus oil will help you achieve the ultimate surfer look, and the matching scent will go well with both men and women.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 14\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 15\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span>BENEFITS:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Won’t weighing down the hair</li>\n<li>Non-aerosol beach-hair spray</li>\n<li>Delivers soft, natural looking hold</li>\n<li>Ideal for fine and longer hair lengths</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<div title=\"Page 61\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>SHAKE. SPRAY. DRY </span><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Spray onto dried hair, and you’re good to go.</span><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","hair-resort":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>BEACH TEXTURISER AND CURL ENHANCER <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>Get the iconic look that Kevin Murphy is renowned for… sexy, surfer texture that defines messy beach hair. An oil-free texturiser and finishing product in-one, HAIR.RESORT allows you to squish, scrunch, and mess-up your ‘doo’ until you achieve just the right texture and look.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Recreate Kevin’s iconic, sexy beach hair look</li>\n<li>Helps enhance curl and define texture</li>\n<li>Provides long-lasting, super-strong hold</li>\n<li>Works in seconds</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:<br></strong>APPLY.SQUISH.SCRUNCH.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Apply HAIR.RESORT to damp or dry hair, scrunch in and you’re good to go.<br>\n<p><strong><br></strong></p>","handmade-soap-666":"<p><strong>Handmade soap - 666</strong><br>The only thing that scares you is what you don't know yet. It scares what you can't touch.<br>We are not superstitious, we believe in the magic of numbers - 666 soap is made for the most daring and strong-willed.<br>We tried dozens of different compositions until we reached perfection - a black square with scrub elements and the smell of perfume with notes of mango.<br>Only natural ingredients and handmade.<br><em>\"Follow your path, and let the people talk.\"</em> - Dante Alighieri</p>\n<p> <strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>olive oil</li>\n<li>coconut oil</li>\n<li>aromatic oils</li>\n<li>lye</li>\n<li>water</li>\n<li>activated carbon</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<ul></ul>\n</div>","handmade-soap-rule-nr-1":"<p><strong>Handmade soap - Rule Nr 1</strong><br>The things you own eventually own you. This soap is the very thing that you do not mind entrusting your life to. Or hygiene. It's up to you. But we, for our part, have made the perfect soap that will not only cleanse your body and your spirit, but will also become a decoration of any bathroom.<br><br>The smell of strawberries and gum will remind you of the First Rule every time you wash your hands or body.<br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Rule Number 1 is a soap made according to Tyler Durden's recipe, with the only difference being that we have chosen not to add human fat to the formula.<br><br><strong>Ingredients:<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>olive oil</li>\n<li>coconut oil</li>\n<li>aromatic oils</li>\n<li>lye</li>\n<li>water</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<ul></ul>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-blow-dry-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>NOURISHING AND REPAIRING SHAMPOO</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Hydrolysed Pea Protein and our Wood Bark Complex work together to help strengthen and protect hair against breakage with added protection against heat damage*. A sulphate-free wash that hydrates while repairing and nourishing. *When used as a part of the BLOW.DRY REGIMEN. ** At KEVIN.MURPHY we are committed to the environment. Please learn more about our evolving packaging initiative.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<p><span>• Hydrating</span></p>\n<p><span>• Nourishing</span></p>\n<p><span>• Strengthening</span></p>\n<p><span>• Heat protection</span></p>\n<p><span>• Colour safe</span></p>\n<p><span>• Smooths</span></p>\n<p><span>• Safe for everyday use</span></p>\n\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Directions: Apply to wet hair and massage into hair and scalp. Rinse and repeat. For best results style with a BLOW.DRY EVER by KEVIN.MURPHY styling product of choice.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-full-again":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>REPAIRING THICKENING LOTION</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Fulfill all your fullness dreams with FULL.AGAIN - our hardworking thickening lotion that boosts body and bounce. Created with an abundance of tiny rayon particles that adhere to the hair shaft making it appear fuller, FULL.AGAIN creates naturally soft movement, leaving fine or thinning hair looking lush and beauty-FULL.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add fullness without weighing down the hair</li>\n<li>Creates natural movement and body</li>\n<li>Helps to fortify and strengthen the hair</li>\n<li>Creates volume, while delivering softness and shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for fine and thinning hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>APPLY. BOOST. STYLE – </strong><span>Apply from mid lengths through to the ends of damp hair before styling. Style as desired.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-killer-twirls":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>NOURISHING CURL REFINING AIR-DRY CRÈME BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>Define, enhance, and refine naturally textured or permed hair with our NEW KILLER products!<br>Enhance your hair’s texture. This leave-in styler helps to define while keeping hair hydrated and protected against humidity and adding shine. Just twirl and go!<br><strong><strong>BENEFITS:<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Hydrating &amp; nourishing</li>\n<li>Refines texture</li>\n<li>Improves shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for both naturally curly &amp; permed hair</li>\n<li>Enhances &amp; defines curls</li>\n<li>Smooths curls</li>\n<li>Strengthening</li>\n<li>Colour-safe</li>\n<li>Vegan<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apply a small amount to towel dried or damp hair, scrunch in or twirl to activate curl. A little goes a long way.</span><br>","kevin-murphy-motion-lotion":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<strong><strong>CURL ENHANCING LOTION FOR FINE HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<div>\n<div>Enhance curls, and get frizz under control with MOTION.LOTION. Our weightless, highly-absorbent treatment lotion is super-charged with beneficial ingredients to deliver flexible hold, and natural-looking shine.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Curl enhancer and finishing lotion in-one</li>\n<li>Flexible weightless hold</li>\n<li>Boosts hair’s natural shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for defining curls in long or fine hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. SCRUNCH. TWIRL.<br>Apply MOTION.LOTION to damp hair to define curls in long or fine hair. Scrunch into the ends and mid lengths, and twirl to absorb the benefits.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>","kevin-murphy-un-tangled-spray":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>DETANGLING LEAVE-IN CONDITIONER</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>No need to tearfully tear those tangles away – allow UN.TANGLED to do all the hard work for you. Our leave-in conditioner is formulated with a complex blend of nourishing Australian Fruit Extracts that help detangle, strengthen and restore hair to sleek perfection. Added heat protection also helps guard against styling damage.</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infused with a unique blend of Australian Fruit Extracts</li>\n<li>Gently detangles the hair</li>\n<li>Helps restore, strengthen retain moisture in the hair</li>\n<li>Provides heat protection against styling damage</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>SHAKE. SPRAY.UNTANGLE</strong><span>. Spray onto wet hair, gently comb through and leave.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","killer-curls-rinse":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>NOURISHING CURL OAT MILK CONDITIONER <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>A nourishing Oat Milk conditioner that deeply hydrates and strengthens, diminishing the likelihood of breakage. Protects against colour fading and refines texture for soft and bouncy curls that are shiny and defined.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hydrating &amp; nourishing</li>\n<li>Refines texture</li>\n<li>Improves shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for both naturally curly &amp; permed hair</li>\n<li>Strengthening</li>\n<li>Colour-safe</li>\n<li>Vegan</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Apply to freshly washed hair, leave for 1-2 minutes and rinse. For best results, follow with KILLER.TWIRLS or products from the CURL Regimen.<strong><br></strong>","killer-curls-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>NOURISHING CURL OAT MILK SHAMPOO <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong><br>A nourishing Oat Milk shampoo that gently cleanses hair while protecting the cuticle. Its ingredients, rich in fatty acids, preserve the hair’s strength and retain moisture to enhance texture for healthy, shiny hair.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hydrating &amp; nourishing</li>\n<li>Enhances curl &amp; refines texture</li>\n<li>Ideal for both naturally curly &amp; permed hair</li>\n<li>Smooths curls</li>\n<li>Colour-safe</li>\n<li>Vegan</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:<br></strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Apply to wet hair and massage into hair and scalp. Rinse and repeat.</span><br><strong><br></strong>","killer-curls":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>LEAVE-IN ANTI-FRIZZ DEFINING CRÈME FOR CURLY AND COILY HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>This is one killer anti-frizz curl definer that will put the spring back into sad, straggly curls. KILLER.CURLS, our antioxidant rich, leave-in anti-frizz defining crème, helps to activate curls while adding essential moisture to throw out the frizz. Curls look and feel natural and soft, as KILLER.CURLS delivers the ideal balance of strong hold and elasticity to the hair.<br>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Antioxidant-rich anti-frizz, curl defining creme</li>\n<li>Helps hydrate and strengthen the hair</li>\n<li>Creates a natural feel and motion to the hair</li>\n<li>Delivers weightless, long-lasting smoothness</li>\n<li>Offers heat protection up to 420°F / 216°C</li>\n<li>Reduces friction for easier combing</li>\n<li>Ideal for medium to coarse, curly or wavy hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. SCRUNCH. CURL.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply </span>KILLER.CURLS<strong> </strong><span>to damp or towel-dried hair, scrunch in to activate the curls and you are ready to bounce.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","king-of-the-night-deep-cut-t-shirt-with-an-extended-back":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>\"King Of The Night\" UNISEX deep V-neck T-shirt with an extended back </strong></p>\n<p><span>Made of high-quality materials that ensure comfort and allow the skin to breathe.</span><br><br><span>The fabric contains elastane, which is stretchy and fits the figure. The material is wear-resistant and does not lose its shape after repeated washing. Does not fade over time.</span><br><br><strong>Print:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hypoallergenic paint</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for washing in the washing machine. It is recommended to use the delicate wash (hand wash) mode.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Composition:<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cotton 98%</li>\n<li>Spandex 2%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Care guide:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hand wash/machine wash up to 30°C</span></li>\n<li><span>The maximum ironing temperature is 110°C</span></li>\n<li><span>Do not bleach</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for dry cleaning</span></li>\n<li><span>Drying on a horizontal surface in a straightened state</span></li>\n<li><span>Tumble drying is prohibited</span></li>\n</ul>","lumin-skin-charcoal-face-wash-daily-detox":"<p><strong>CHARCOAL FACE WASH DAILY DETOX BY LUMIN SKIN<br></strong>A purifying charcoal face wash for men that is suitable for all skin types.<br>Get the grim off your face. Use daily for skin that feels fresh and energized.<br><strong>BENEFITS:<meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Removes excess oil and rebalances the skin</li>\n<li>Lathers to a creamy foam, perfect for gently removing oil and dirt</li>\n<li>Daily use will help pores appear smaller and tighter, and the skin’s surface to look smooth</li>\n<li>The easiest first step you can take to build a skincare routine</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br>\n<p><strong></strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Wet your hands and work up a lather with a quarter-sized amount of charcoal face cleanser. Then massage all over the face in circular motions. Rinse with warm water and pat dry, then follow with your skincare routine.</span></p>","lumin-skin-charcoal-scrub-deep-detox":"<p><strong>CHARCOAL SCRUB DEEP DETOX BY LUMIN SKIN</strong><br>A charcoal face exfoliator that refreshes &amp; rejuvenates the skin.<br>Charcoal draws out dirt and oil from your grimy pores. Jojoba Esters plus Centella Asiaticia help smooth out rough skin.<br><strong>BENEFITS:<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The gentle chemical exfoliant removes dead skin cells and smooths texture<br>\n</li>\n<li>No harsh exfoliating beads</li>\n<li>Cellulose gently pills to remove rough skin texture, while Charcoal pulls out impurities from the pores</li>\n<li>If you have blemish prone, oily skin - this is your new go-to</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><span>Start with damp or dry, clean skin. Wet your hands then massage a quarter-sized amount of charcoal face scrub in circular motions all over your face to remove any dead skin particles. Rinse with warm water and pat dry, then follow with your skincare routine.<br><br></span>\n<h4>\n<br><br><br>\n</h4>","lumin-skin-dark-circle-defense-balm":"<strong><strong>DARK CIRCLE DEFENSE BALM BY LUMIN SKIN<br></strong></strong>A men's daily under eye cream for dark circles, fine lines, &amp; wrinkles that is suitable for all skin types.<br>Looks like you slept a solid eight hours(even when you didn't). Use daily to calm puffy eyes, target dark circles, and soften the look of fine lines.<br><strong><strong>BENEFITS:<br></strong></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>A lightweight gel texture that glides on and absorbs seamlessly</li>\n<li>Instantly plumps dehydration lines</li>\n<li>Fights the appearance of crows feet and temporarily reduces the appearance of puffiness</li>\n<li>It's basically an espresso shot for your eyes</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><span>Press the pump once for the perfect amount of under eye cream. Then, use your ring finger to lightly tap the product below your eye. Repeat on the other side.</span><br>","lumin-skin-recovery-oil":"<strong><strong>RECOVERY OIL BY LUMIN SKIN<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>A face oil stick with squalane &amp; argan oil made for maximum skin repair that is suitable for all skin types.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Offers deep hydration and maximum skin repair on the fly</li>\n<li>Calms inflamed skin and fortifies the skin's protective barrier</li>\n<li>Infused with vitamin E for a collagen boost</li>\n<li>Pocket-sized and cleared for travel</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Roll the face oil serum stick onto your cheeks, around your nose, and over any dry, flaky areas. You can apply the oil throughout the day as needed for instant hydration.</span><br>","lumin-skin-wrinkle-defense-serum":"<strong><strong>WRINKLE DEFENSE SERUM BY LUMIN SKIN<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>A high-strength men's anti-aging serum with vitamin C that is suitable for all skin types.<span><br></span><strong><strong>BENEFITS:<meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>An active, targeted serum for fine lines and wrinkles</li>\n<li>Can help minimize the appearance of dark spots to promote healthy looking skin</li>\n<li>Evens skin tone</li>\n<li>Defend against wrinkles, not bad old age jokes</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Press the pump once into your hand for the perfect amount of anti-wrinkle serum, then blend into any problem areas. When using in the morning, ensure you follow up with SPF.<strong><br></strong>","mandom-gatsby-moving-rubber":"<p><strong>Mat &amp; Hard Lift-Up Wax – Strong Hold with a Matte Finish 80g</strong></p>\n<p>Achieve a bold, lifted style with <strong>Mat &amp; Hard Lift-Up Wax</strong>, designed for long-lasting hold and effortless re-styling throughout the day. This <strong>Mat Dry Formula</strong> provides a strong yet flexible hold while remaining easy to wash off.</p>\n<h3><strong>BENEFITS</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Matte, Long-Lasting Hold:</strong> Creates defined styles with a non-greasy finish.<br><strong>Re-Style Anytime:</strong> Moving Rubber technology ensures elasticity and styling memory.*¹<br><strong>Hair-Friendly Formula:</strong> Contains moisture-retaining ingredients to keep hair healthy.*²<br><strong>Light &amp; Fresh Scent:</strong> A subtle floral fragrance that doesn’t linger.</p>\n<p><strong>Available Size:</strong> 80g</p>\n<h3><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></h3>\n<p>Take a small amount and rub between your palms.<br>Apply evenly to dry hair, focusing on the ends for texture and movement.<br>Style as desired and re-work anytime.<br>Always close the cap tightly after use.</p>","maxi-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>DETOX SHAMPOO <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Designed to deliver a much-needed detox, MAXI.WASH removes the build-up of unwanted products and chemicals from the hair. Our gentle detoxifying shampoo helps to purify for a clean, clear and refreshed scalp, and our soothing blend of essential oils brightens the hair while purifying and balancing the scalp. Its deep cleansing action provides a thorough cleanse without stripping the hair of essential oils.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently yet effectively removes unwanted product and mineral buildup</li>\n<li>Detoxifies and stimulates sluggish scalps</li>\n<li>Prepares the hair to receive essential nutrients</li>\n<li>An ideal pre-colour treatment shampoo</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. DETOX</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp (do not scrub) leave for 1 minute and rinse.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","night-rider":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>MATTE, TEXTURE AND DEFINITION PASTE <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Buckle-up for a tough ride with NIGHT.RIDER, the strongest of our hardworking moulding pastes. Designed to deliver rough, matte texture to enhance short or choppy looks, our state-of-the-art paste helps seal in moisture to prevent hair breakage, and helps hair appear healthier and full of shine.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong hold</li>\n<li>Delivers a rough, matte texture</li>\n<li>Helps seal in moisture</li>\n<li>Boosts shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair desiring texture and separation</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">RUB. APPLY. DRY.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Rub a small amount of </span>NIGHT.RIDER<span> between your palms and distribute evenly through damp or dry hair.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex-with-print-love-is-the-gun":"<p><strong>LOVE IS THE GUN</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>The oversized unisex T-shirt with print is a true street fashion icon, suitable for both men and women. </span></p>\n<p><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></p>\n<p><span>Material: 100% cotton </span></p>\n<p><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></p>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex-with-print-t-shirt-three-elements-fire":"<p><strong>REMPIRE T-shirt “Three Elements” — Japanese Style</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Design by Roman Warwink</strong></p>\n<p>These T-shirts intertwine three powerful elements — <strong>water</strong>, <strong>fire</strong>, and <strong>air</strong>. Each carries its own symbolism: balance, strength, and freedom. The original artwork is inspired by traditional Japanese woodblock prints, featuring dynamic lines and expressive details.</p>\n<ul>\n<li> Original print — exclusive Japanese-style design</li>\n<li><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></li>\n<li><span>Material: 100% cotton</span></li>\n<li><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Elements in every detail:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Fire</strong> — energy and drive forward<br>💧 <strong>Water</strong> — purity and calm<br>🌬 <strong>Air</strong> — freedom and motion</p>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex-with-print-t-shirt-three-elements-water":"<p><strong>REMPIRE T-shirt “Three Elements” — Japanese Style</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Design by Roman Warwink</strong></p>\n<p>These T-shirts intertwine three powerful elements — <strong>water</strong>, <strong>fire</strong>, and <strong>air</strong>. Each carries its own symbolism: balance, strength, and freedom. The original artwork is inspired by traditional Japanese woodblock prints, featuring dynamic lines and expressive details.</p>\n<ul>\n<li> Original print — exclusive Japanese-style design</li>\n<li><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></li>\n<li><span>Material: 100% cotton</span></li>\n<li><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Elements in every detail:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Fire</strong> — energy and drive forward<br>💧 <strong>Water</strong> — purity and calm<br>🌬 <strong>Air</strong> — freedom and motion</p>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex":"<p><strong>YOUR PRETTY FACE IS GOING TO HELL</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>The oversized unisex T-shirt with print is a true street fashion icon, suitable for both men and women. </span></p>\n<p><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></p>\n<p><span>Material: 100% cotton </span></p>\n<p><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></p>\n\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-clear-styling-glaze":"<p><b>A lightweight styling gel</b> with <span><b>soft hold</b></span> and a <span><b>memory effect</b></span> that can be reactivated with water or heat.<br>The minimalist formula contains <span><b>only 7 carefully selected ingredients</b></span>. Dermatologist- and pediatrician-tested, free from fragrances and colorants. Helps create hairstyles without irritating sensitive scalp and skin and is suitable for daily use</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides soft hold with lasting style memory</li>\n<li>Can be reactivated with water or heat</li>\n<li>Helps style hair without irritating sensitive scalp and skin</li>\n<li>Contains only 7 carefully selected ingredients</li>\n<li>Fragrance-free and colorant-free</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply to damp or dry hair and style as desired. For best results, use after <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-shampoo\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Clear Essential Shampoo</a> and <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-conditioner\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Clear Essential Conditioner</a></p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The minimalist formula in Clear Styling Glaze contains <span><b>7 carefully selected ingredients</b></span> to help deliver <span><b>soft hold</b></span> and <span><b>reactivatable style memory</b></span> without irritating sensitive scalp and skin<b></b></p>","paul-mitchell-mitch-construction-paste-flexible-styling-paste":"<p><b>Build your look</b> with this <span><b>flexible styling paste</b></span> that lets you easily reshape hair without flaking or leaving behind residue.<br>The formula helps form, separate and define hair with <span><b>medium hold</b></span> and a <span><b>low-shine finish</b></span>. It is ideal for messy, textured styles and for defining waves and curls, while keeping hair soft and manageable</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types, especially short to medium lengths</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forms, separates and defines hair</li>\n<li>Provides medium hold with a low-shine finish</li>\n<li>Creates crunch-free, flake-free styles</li>\n<li>Leaves hair soft and manageable</li>\n<li>Suitable for short to medium lengths</li>\n<li>Color-safe formula</li>\n<li>Vegan</li>\n<li>Paraben-free</li>\n<li>Made without gluten</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Activate by vigorously working paste into hands, then distribute through damp or dry hair</p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The flexible, mesh-like formula in Construction Paste helps <span><b>shape and reshape hair</b></span>, providing <span><b>medium hold</b></span> and a <span><b>low-shine finish</b></span> without crunch or flakes<b></b></p>","paul-mitchell-mitch-steady-grip-styling-gel":"<p><b>Get a steady grip on any style</b> with this styling gel that helps hair look thicker while shaping and separating with <span><b>medium hold</b></span> and <span><b>medium shine</b></span>.<br>The <span><b>alcohol-free</b></span> formula helps prevent drying and flaking, leaving hair polished with a clean finish</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types. Ideal for fine and thinning hair, thick or coarse hair, and for defining curls on damp hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shapes and separates any style</li>\n<li>Helps hair look and feel thicker</li>\n<li>Provides medium hold with medium shine</li>\n<li>Leaves a clean, flake-free finish</li>\n<li>Non-drying formula</li>\n<li>Color-safe</li>\n<li>Vegan</li>\n<li>Paraben-free</li>\n<li>Made without gluten </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply a small amount to palms and distribute through damp hair for lighter hold or through dry hair for stronger hold. For thick or coarse hair, apply a small amount to damp or dry hair and add more if needed. For fine or thinning hair, apply a small amount to dry hair</p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>Long-lasting styling fixatives in Steady Grip Styling Gel help provide all-day hold, while shine enhancers leave hair looking polished and the alcohol-free formula helps prevent drying and flakes<b></b></p>","paul-mitchell-super-skinny-serum":"<p>A best-selling smoothing serum that helps speed up blow-drying and delivers silky, frizz-free results. <b>Super Skinny Serum</b> provides heat protection up to 450°F (230°C) while reducing drying time for faster styling.</p>\n<p>The humidity-resistant formula with lightweight silicones smooths the hair cuticle, reduces frizz, and leaves hair sleek, shiny, and manageable in any weather.</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types, including fine hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Speeds up drying time</li>\n<li>Provides heat protection up to 450°F (230°C)</li>\n<li>Smooths and controls frizz</li>\n<li>Leaves hair silky and shiny</li>\n<li>Lightweight, non-greasy formula</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Highly concentrated—use sparingly. Rub one pump into hands and apply to clean, damp hair. Style as desired.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<p>Lightweight silicones in Super Skinny Serum help smooth hair, seal the cuticle and resist humidity, while the Super Skinny Complex helps reduce drying time for silky, shiny, frizz-free results.</p>","powder-puff":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>WEIGHTLESS VOLUMISING POWDER <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong>\n</div>\n<div>An instant poof in a jar! Here’s the perfect little PUFF to create the coveted messy, casual volume that everyone desires. Simply tap gently, apply a few shakes onto the hair and the powder morphs into a setting product with lasting hold. Builds body with ease, and is suitable for all hair types. The magic of our special little PUFF is all in the technology – imagine a hardworking volumising lotion, locked inside a sphere of powder – then imagine the sphere making contact with the hair – Va Va Voom, and the magic happens. The lotion lifts the hair, and the powder simultaneously dries the lotion, giving your hair some serious extra oomph.</div>\n<div>\n<strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"false\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Weightless volumising powder doesn’t weigh the hair down</li>\n<li>Unique dry-matte texture</li>\n<li>Targeted application to boost flat hair of any type</li>\n<li>Setting lotion encapsulated in a powder sphere</li>\n<li>Provides instant volume and body</li>\n<li>Ideal for fine or flat hair or for just a little extra oomph</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<ul></ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>SHAKE. PUFF. CREATE.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Sprinkle </span>POWDER.PUFF<span> onto dry hair at the roots to create volume and texture.</span><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>","proraso-aftershave-balm-green-refreshing-alcohol-free-mentholated-100ml":"<p>Proraso green refreshing aftershave balm with Eucalyptus Oil and menthol moisturises and tones the skin after shaving. Alcohol free formulation </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alcohol free.</li>\n<li>Contains Eucalyptus Oil and menthol</li>\n<li>Contains no parabens, silicons, mineral oils or artificial colours.</li>\n<li>Made in Italy.</li>\n<li>100ml bottle</li>\n</ul>","proraso-azur-lime-after-shave-balm-100-ml":"<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Proraso Single Blade After Shave Balm</strong><br>Professional-grade skincare, now available for your daily routine. Originally developed for barbers, the <em>Single Blade</em> line is specially formulated for use with single-blade razors—delivering a close, smooth shave with expert-level aftercare.</p>\n<p>This ultra-rich yet lightweight after shave balm combines the regenerating power of a cream with a fast-absorbing, non-greasy finish. Enriched with nourishing Shea Butter Oil and hydrating Glycerin, it soothes irritation, relieves dryness, and deeply restores the skin after shaving.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Originally created for professional barbers</li>\n<li>Ideal for use after single-blade shaving</li>\n<li>Rich in Shea Butter Oil and Glycerin</li>\n<li>Calms, moisturizes, and regenerates the skin</li>\n<li>Non-greasy, fast-absorbing formula</li>\n<li>For external use only<br>\n</li>\n<li>100ml bottle</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>","proraso-beard-oil-azur-lime-30ml":"<p><strong>Beard oil</strong>: Caring and protective. Smells fresh of lime, citrus and mint. Tames and smooths beards, makes them softer and leaves a silky shine.</p>\n<p><strong>Directions</strong>: apply a dime size quantity or more, if needed, to the palms of your hands and rub through a damp beard starting from the roots to the tip of the beard.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>30ml</li>\n<li>Dermatologist tested</li>\n<li>Made in Italy</li>\n</ul>","proraso-beard-oil-cypress-vetyver-30ml":"<p><strong>Beard oil:</strong> Caring and protective. <span>Masculine scent of cypress and fresh vetyver.</span> Tames and smooths beards, makes them softer and leaves a silky shine.</p>\n<p><strong>Directions:</strong> apply a dime size quantity or more, if needed, to the palms of your hands and rub through a damp beard starting from the roots to the tip of the beard.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>30ml</li>\n<li>Dermatologist tested</li>\n<li>Made in Italy</li>\n</ul>","proraso-beard-oil-green-refreshing-30ml":"<p>A new addition to Proraso's classic Green line, this beard oil is fragranced with their classic bergamot, eucalyptus and rosemary oil blend.</p>\n<p>Directions: apply a dime size quantity or more, if needed, to the palms of your hands and rub through a damp beard starting from the roots to the tip of the beard.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>30ml</li>\n<li>Dermatologist tested</li>\n<li>Made in Italy</li>\n</ul>","proraso-beard-oil-wood-spice-cedar-wood-citrus-fragrance-30ml":"<p><strong>Beard oil:</strong> formulated for a long thick beard to tame, smooth, soften and protect. A scent of cedar wood with notes of Mediterranean citrus leaves a pleasurable fresh sensation.</p>\n<p><strong>Directions:</strong> apply a dime sized quantity or more, if needed, to the palms of your hands and rub through a damp beard starting from the roots to the tip of the beard.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>30ml</li>\n<li>Dermatologist tested</li>\n<li>Made in Italy</li>\n</ul>","proraso-blue-protect-aftershave-balm-aloe-and-vitamin-e-100ml":"<p>Proraso Blue protective aftershave balm with Aloe and Vitamin E will calm and revitalise the skin. The alcohol free formulation contains skin healing ingredients such as Aloe Vera and Vitamin E which helps moisturise and repair shaving irritations. Proraso Blue balm has a very pleasant fresh citrus <span>f</span>ragrance and leaves the skin with a beautiful moisturis<span>ed</span> feel.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alcohol free.</li>\n<li>Contains Aloe, Vitamin E</li>\n<li>Ideal for sensitive skin.</li>\n<li>Made in Italy.</li>\n<li><span>100ml bottle</span></li>\n</ul>","proraso-green-refreshing-aftershave-lotion-menthol-splash-100ml":"<p> A daily aid to complete the shaving ritual, giving immediate relief to the skin. The traditional formula has been enriched with a selection of fresh and natural ingredients that make it particularly refreshing and invigorating. Eucalyptus Oil and Menthol, provide immediate relief after shaving, toning and refreshing the skin.<br><br>Apply to your face massaging gently to facilitate absorption.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alcohol based</li>\n<li>Contains Eucalyptus oil and menthol</li>\n<li>100ml</li>\n<li>Made in Italy.</li>\n</ul>","proraso-red-nourishing-aftershave-lotion-100ml":"<p>A daily aid to complete the shaving ritual, giving immediate relief to the skin. The formula, enriched with Sandalwood Oil and Shea Butter, softens the skin, making it more elastic with a calming and soothing effect. It leaves the skin with an intense fragrance.</p>\n<p>Apply to your face massaging gently to facilitate absorption.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alcohol based</li>\n<li>Contains Sandalwood Oil and Shea Butter</li>\n<li>100ml</li>\n<li>Made in Italy.</li>\n</ul>","proraso-white-aftershave-balm-soothing-for-sensitive-skin-100ml":"<p>A soothing post-shave balm with extract of Aloe, Oatmeal and Green Tea. Rich, refreshing and hydrating, leaves your skin smooth, soft and fresh.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alcohol free.</li>\n<li>Contains Aloe, Oatmeal and Green Tea extracts</li>\n<li>Ideal for sensitive skin.</li>\n<li>Made in Italy.</li>\n</ul>","proraso-wood-spice-beard-balm-100ml":"<h3><strong>Proraso Beard Balm – Wood &amp; Spice</strong></h3>\n<p>Soothes itch, nourishes the beard, and leaves it with a masculine scent.</p>\n<p>Specially designed for the first stages of beard growth — relieves itchiness and discomfort, softens the beard, and cares for the skin. The formula, with 91% natural ingredients, reduces dryness and static, locks in moisture, and restores skin tone.<br>The <strong>Wood &amp; Spice</strong> fragrance is warm, spicy, and truly masculine.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves itch during new beard growth<br>\n</li>\n<li>Nourishes and softens the beard<br>\n</li>\n<li>91% natural ingredients<br>\n</li>\n<li>Free from silicones, parabens, mineral oils, and SLS<br>\n</li>\n<li>No animal-derived ingredients<br>\n</li>\n<li> Made in Italy</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Volume: 100 ml</p>","repair-me-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>RESTORATIVE, STRENGTHENING SHAMPOO FOR DRY AND BRITTLE HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Nourish overtaxed hair back to life, and make dry, damaged, frizzy over-processed hair a thing of the past with a little help from REPAIR-ME.WASH. Prepare to renew and restore frazzled locks with our reconstructing treatment shampoo enriched with powerful proteins and amino acids. It will help to strengthen the hair from root to tip, while gently removing impurities and soothing damage.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A power-packed blend of proteins and enzymes</li>\n<li>Helps nourish, restore and replenish the hair</li>\n<li>Helps hair look and feel smoother and stronger</li>\n<li>Provides a boost of essential moisture</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types in need of targeted repair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p>Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse. Follow with REPAIR-ME.RINSE. Can be used daily, and as part of our REPAIR regimen.</p>\n<p><em>Note:</em> You might not need to wash your hair daily, but remember to always use REPAIR-ME.WASH and RINSE for two consecutive washes even if they are apart, and then replace both with RE.STORE for the third wash.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","roja-scandal-parfum-pour-femme-50ml":"<h3><strong>Roja Scandal Parfum Pour Femme 50ml – Bold Elegance in a Bottle</strong></h3>\n<p>Indulge in the captivating allure of <strong>Roja Scandal</strong>, a fragrance that blends timeless sophistication with modern confidence. Designed for the woman who commands attention, this scent unfolds in layers of freshness, floral beauty, and sensual warmth.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>A Sparkling Opening</strong> – Bright citrus notes of bergamot and lemon create a fresh, invigorating introduction.<br><strong>A Heart of Pure Elegance</strong> – Jasmine, rose, and tuberose weave together in a refined floral bouquet, exuding grace and femininity.<br><strong>A Seductive, Lasting Trail</strong> – Warm sandalwood, musk, and vanilla leave a luxurious and unforgettable impression.</p>\n<h3><strong>For Women Who Own the Spotlight</strong></h3>\n<p>Whether you're stepping into a high-powered meeting, enjoying an intimate dinner, or making an entrance at an exclusive event, <strong>Roja Scandal Pour Femme</strong> is the perfect signature scent. Bold yet refined, it embodies confidence, allure, and undeniable sophistication.</p>","rough-rider":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>STRONG HOLD, MOLDABLE STYLING CLAY <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Rough up, and get down and gritty to create a seriously strong hold with ROUGH.RIDER. Its oily, gritty-like texture helps you define a slick, matte look that lasts. Infused with antioxidants and essential extracts it packs a goodness punch as strong as it holds. ROUGH.RIDER also strengthens and helps seal rough ends.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong hold</li>\n<li>Delivers a slick, matte defined look</li>\n<li>Helps strengthen the hair as it holds</li>\n<li>Helps to seal rough ends</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">RUB. APPLY. DRY.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Rub a small amount of </span>ROUGH.RIDER<span> between your palms and distribute evenly through damp or dry hair.</span>\n</div>\n</div>","siim-hanikat-x-rempire":"<p><strong> SIIM HANIKAT X REMPIRE </strong></p>\n<p><span>The oversized unisex T-shirt with print </span><span>is a true street fashion icon, suitable for both men and women. </span></p>\n<p><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></p>\n<p><span>Material: 100% cotton </span></p>\n<p><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></p>\n<p><span>DTG print</span></p>\n<!---->","sim-sensitive-system-4-chitosan-hair-repair-r":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>CHITOSAN HAIR REPAIR R BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Treatment spray for dry and damaged hair<strong><br></strong>Hair care spray. Chitosan and keratin restore hair damage and prevent split ends. Moisturizes and protects hair from external damage and UV rays.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Effectively moisturizes hair</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Protects against UV rays</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Spray on dry towel after shampooing. Do not rinse.</p>\n<p>pH 3.5</p>","sim-sensitive-system-4-oil-cure-scalp-treatment-o":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>OIL CURE SCALP TREATMENT O BY SYSTEM 4</strong><br>Therapeutic, exfoliating and caring scalp mask<strong><br></strong>Oil Cure Scalp Treatment Mask is specially formulated to ensure the well-being of the scalp. It gently exfoliates the scalp while removing dandruff, grease and hair residue. Moisturizes, relieves itching and scalp irritation. Can also be used as a conditioner for hair lenghts. The product moisturizes the hair and gives it shine. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently exfoliates the scalp</li>\n<li>Soothes itchy and irritated scalp</li>\n<li>Moisturizes hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Makes hair shiny beautifully</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The tube is made of 50% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply mask to washed scalp and rub lightly with fingertips in a circular motion. If desired, add to the length of the hair. Leave on for 5-30 minutes and rinse well.</p>\n<p>pH 3.0</p>","sim-sensitive-system-4-scalp-tonic-t":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>SCALP TONIC T BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Therapeutic tonic for oily scalp<strong><br></strong>Suitable for daily use, Scalp Tonic dissolves crystallized oil, prevents scalp oiling and relieves itching. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Menthol refreshes and stimulates the superficial blood flow to the scalp. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevents scalp oiling</li>\n<li>Removes greasy dandruff and prevents it from forming again</li>\n<li>Soothes itchy scalp</li>\n<li>Improves scalp microcirculation</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply directly to the scalp and rub the scalp lightly with your fingertips. Do not rinse. Can be used daily and also between washes.</p>\n<p>pH 3.5</p>","super-goo":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>RUBBERY SCULPTING GEL FOR SLICK FINISH <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Is it a paste? Is it a gel? No… it’s SUPER.GOO. Packed with super-hero qualities to create a firm-holding, rubbery-gel that dries to a slick natural finish. Super-defined texture and style are created from our no-flake, water-soluble setting and moulding gel, that not only enhances volume and hold, but doubles up as a great curl enhancer.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Firm holding, yet flexible rubbery gel</li>\n<li>Provides a slick, natural finish</li>\n<li>Defines texture and movement in the hair</li>\n<li>Water soluble</li>\n<li>Ideal for controlling all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. STYLE. HOLD.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply </span>SUPER.GOO <span>to damp or dry hair.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","system-4-balancing-shampoo-2":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BALANCING SHAMPOO 2 BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Therapeutic shampoo for dry scalp and colored hair<strong><br></strong>Special effective shampoo for deep care of colored hair and dry scalp. Reduces dandruff and soothes scalp itching and irritation. Specially developed to support the natural moisture balance of the scalp and hair and to protect the hair color. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Climbazole prevents dandruff. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Soothes dry itchy itching and irritation</li>\n<li>Removes dandruff and prevents it from recurring</li>\n<li>Protects against hair color fading</li>\n<li>Increases hair shine</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><span>Apply shampoo thoroughly to hair &amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than with regular shampoo.</span></p>\n<p>pH 4.7</p>","system-4-bio-botanical-serum":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div itemprop=\"description\">\n<p><strong>BIO BOTANICAL SERUM BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Scalp circulatory stimulating serum<strong><br></strong>Serum that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp for all hair types. Antiseptic natural extracts, salicylic acid and menthol disinfect and soothe the scalp, while refreshing and limiting sebum secretion. Regular use creates conditions for healthy hair growth. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><b>BENEFITS:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creates suitable conditions for the growth of healthy hair on the scalp</li>\n<li>Stimulates the microcirculation of the scalp</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply serum directly to scalp and rub into scalp with light rotating motions. Do not rinse. Can be used daily or between washes. Used to support the effects of Bio Botanical Shampoo and Vital Cure.</p>\n<p>pH 4.3</p>\n</div>\n</div>","system-4-bio-botanical-shampoo":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>Shampoo for thinning hair<br></strong>Shampoo that maintains the natural balance and well-being of the scalp and is suitable for all hair types. Contains soothing and exfoliating active ingredients, a mixture of plant extract that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp and refreshing menthol. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creates conditions for healthy hair growth on the scalp</li>\n<li>Stimulates the microcirculation of the scalp</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Perfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply shampoo to damp hair &amp; scalp. Foam and leave on for 2-5 minutes. Rinse well.</p>\n<p>pH 4.8</p>","system-4-bio-botanical-vital-cure":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BIO BOTANICAL VITAL CURE BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Conditioner for thinning hair<strong><br></strong>Conditioner that maintains the natural balance and well-being of the scalp and is suitable for all hair types. Contains a mixture of soothing and exfoliating active ingredients and a plant extract that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp. Regular use creates conditions for healthy hair growth. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><b>BENEFITS:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently exfoliates the scalp</li>\n<li>Creates conditions for healthy hair growth on the scalp</li>\n<li>Stimulates the microcirculation of the scalp</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The tube is made of 50% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply Vital Cure to Towel Dry Hair &amp; Scalp. Leave on hair for 2-5 minutes. Leave on for 15-30 minutes as a scalp treatment. The heat increases the effect of maintenance. Rinse well.</p>\n<p>pH 3.5</p>","system-4-hydro-care-conditioner-h":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>HYDRO CARE CONDITIONER H BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Therapeutic conditioner for colored and dry hair<strong><br></strong>Effective, moisturizing hair conditioner. Supports the hair's natural moisture balance and its soothing ingredients prevent dandruff, itching and redness of the scalp. Protects hair color from fading, gives hair a beautiful shine and makes hair easier to handle. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Effectively moisturizes hair</li>\n<li>Protects against hair color fading</li>\n<li>Prevents itching and redness of the scalp</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The tube is made of 50% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>After shampooing, apply conditioner to towel-dried hair &amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse thoroughly.</p>\n<p>pH 3.0</p>","system-4-mild-shampoo-3":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>MILD SHAMPOO 3 BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Therapeutic shampoo for the well-being of the scalp<strong><br></strong>Special, mild shampoo for everyday use. Prevents dandruff. Soothes itching, keeps the scalp and hair in good condition. Washes effectively but gently, leaving hair clean and shiny. To maintain the results achieved on the scalp, we also recommend using Mild Shampoo as an aftercare. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Climbazole prevents dandruff. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gentle and gentle</li>\n<li>To maintain the results achieved</li>\n<li>Soothes itchy scalp</li>\n<li>Removes dandruff and prevents it from forming</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply shampoo thoroughly to hair &amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than regular shampoo.</p>\n<p>pH 4.7</p>","system-4-special-shampoo-1":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>SPECIAL SHAMPOO 1 BY SYSTEM 4</strong><br>Therapeutic shampoo for oily and flaky scalp<strong><br></strong>Special effective shampoo that removes dandruff and prevents its recurrence. Balances the oiliness of the scalp and soothes itching. Promotes a healthy moisture balance in the scalp. The shampoo contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Climbazole prevents dandruff. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Removes greasy dandruff and prevents it from forming again</li>\n<li>Soothes itching and scalp irritation</li>\n<li>Perfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply shampoo thoroughly to hair &amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than with regular shampoo.</p>\n<p>pH 4.7</p>\n<br>","three-kings":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>\"Three Kings\" UNISEX deep V-neck T-shirt with an extended back </strong><br></p>\n<p><span>Made of high-quality materials that ensure comfort and allow the skin to breathe.</span><br><br><span>The fabric contains elastane, which is stretchy and fits the figure. The material is wear-resistant and does not lose its shape after repeated washing. Does not fade over time.</span><br><br><strong>Print:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hypoallergenic paint</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for washing in the washing machine. It is recommended to use the delicate wash (hand wash) mode.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Composition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Cotton 98%</span></li>\n<li><span>Spandex 2%</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Care guide:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hand wash/machine wash up to 30°C</span></li>\n<li><span>The maximum ironing temperature is 110°C</span></li>\n<li><span>Do not bleach</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for dry cleaning</span></li>\n<li><span>Drying on a horizontal surface in a straightened state</span></li>\n<li><span>Tumble drying is prohibited</span></li>\n</ul>","tom-ford-black-orchid-eau-de-perfume-spray-100ml":"<p>Elevate your fragrance collection with <strong>Tom Ford Black Orchid</strong>, a timeless masterpiece that embodies luxury, sophistication, and sensuality. Designed to captivate, this unisex fragrance is a bold statement of individuality and elegance.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> An exquisite blend of black truffle, fresh citrus, ylang-ylang, and blackcurrant creates an alluring and vibrant opening.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> The rare black orchid takes center stage, enriched by warm spicy accords for a mysterious and captivating heart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> A rich, velvety base of patchouli, vanilla, amber, sandalwood, and vetiver delivers an unforgettable depth and longevity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unisex Appeal:</strong> Suitable for anyone who appreciates rich, distinctive scents.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sophisticated Design:</strong> Housed in an iconic black flacon with luxurious gold accents, making it as stunning as the fragrance itself.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Elegance:</strong> Perfect for evening wear, special occasions, or whenever you want to leave a lasting impression.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Long-Lasting Formula:</strong> Enjoy hours of captivating scent that lingers beautifully throughout the day.</li>\n</ul>","tom-ford-neroli-port-eau-de-parfum-spray-50ml":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Experience the allure of the Mediterranean with <strong>Tom Ford Neroli Portofino Eau De Parfum</strong>. A fragrance that blends vibrant citrus, delicate florals, and a hint of warmth, it evokes the refreshing breeze and sunlit landscapes of the Italian coast. Designed for both men and women, this luxurious scent offers a perfect balance of elegance and zest, making it a versatile addition to any fragrance collection.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Choose Tom Ford Neroli Portofino?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Refreshing Citrus Blend:</strong> Top notes of bergamot, lemon, and mandarin create an uplifting and energizing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Floral Heart:</strong> Neroli and orange blossom provide a soft, sophisticated floral element that adds depth and richness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Long-lasting Freshness:</strong> Amber and musk base notes give the fragrance a sensual and enduring finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>50ml Bottle:</strong> Ideal for daily use or to take with you on your travels.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Unisex Fragrance:</strong> Perfect for both men and women, offering a timeless scent that suits any occasion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mediterranean Inspiration:</strong> A fragrance that transports you to the idyllic shores of the Italian Riviera.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","touchable":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>SPRAY WAX FINISHING HAIRSPRAY <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>A weightless finishing spray wax that maintains texture and hold to reinforce the appearance of separation. Delivers the finish of a wax with the lightness of a spray, never sticky to the touch. Hibiscus Flower Extract, Milk Thistle, Sea Lavender and Carrot Seed Oil make up a powerful Antioxidant Blend providing the hair with protection and conditioning benefits, complete with a satin sheen.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flexible hold</li>\n<li>Pliable with a satin sheen</li>\n<li>Weightless</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>Shake well and spray onto styled hair.</div>\n</div>","versace-man-fraiche-eau-de-toilette-for-men-100ml":"<p><strong>Versace Man Eau Fraîche Eau de Toilette</strong><br><strong>Fresh. Sophisticated. Effortlessly Masculine.</strong></p>\n<p>Discover a fragrance that captures the essence of Mediterranean charm and laid-back elegance. <em>Versace Man Eau Fraîche</em>is a modern expression of confidence—crisp, aquatic, and irresistibly refined.</p>\n<p><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>A vibrant fusion of <strong>bergamot</strong>, <strong>lemon</strong>, <strong>carambola (star fruit)</strong>, <strong>cardamom</strong>, and <strong>rosewood</strong> bursts open with energy and brightness, setting the tone for a refreshing journey. </p>\n<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>The core reveals a sophisticated mix of <strong>white cedar</strong>, <strong>black pepper</strong>, <strong>sage</strong>, and <strong>tarragon</strong>—herbal, spicy, and deeply aromatic. </p>\n<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>A warm, sensual trail of <strong>amber</strong>, <strong>woody accords</strong>, <strong>musk</strong>, <strong>saffron</strong>, and <strong>sycamore</strong> wraps the scent in elegance and mystery. </p>\n<p><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Aquatic &amp; Woody Fusion:</strong> A crisp scent that’s fresh yet grounded in masculine depth</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Italian Sophistication:</strong> Created by master perfumer Olivier Cresp under the creative vision of Donatella Versace</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Versatile &amp; Modern:</strong> Perfect for daily wear, from the office to an evening out</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Elegant Trail:</strong> Leaves a refined, clean impression without overpowering</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Olfactory Family:</strong> Woody · Aquatic<br><strong>Size:</strong> 100ml<br><strong>For:</strong> Men</p>","xerjoff-1861-naxos-eau-de-parfum-100ml":"<p><strong>Xerjoff Naxos – A Tribute to Italian Elegance</strong></p>\n<p>Immerse yourself in the <strong>essence of Sicily</strong> with <strong>Xerjoff Naxos</strong>, a fragrance that seamlessly blends tradition with a modern twist. This captivating scent embodies <strong>Italian sophistication</strong>, offering a vibrant yet deeply sensual olfactory experience.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> A fresh and uplifting blend of <strong>bergamot, lemon, and lavender</strong> evokes the bright, sunlit landscapes of Italy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> <strong>Cinnamon, honey, cashmere, and jasmine sambac</strong> create a warm and indulgent heart, adding depth and complexity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Rich and grounding <strong>tobacco leaf, tonka bean, and vanilla</strong> deliver an earthy, woody finish that lingers beautifully.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why You’ll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Classic with a Modern Twist</strong> – A timeless fragrance with a contemporary, sophisticated edge.<br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspired by Italian Heritage</strong> – A scent that reflects the grandeur and glamour of Italy.<br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>\\Versatile &amp; Captivating</strong> – Perfect for any occasion, from daytime elegance to evening refinement.<br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Long-Lasting &amp; Intoxicating</strong> – Leaves an unforgettable impression with its deep, warm base.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Xerjoff Naxos</strong> is more than a fragrance—it’s a <strong>celebration of Italian luxury</strong>, bottled to perfection.</p>","xerjoff-tony-iommi-monkey-special-50ml":"<p><strong>Xerjoff Tony Iommi Monkey Special – A Rock ‘n’ Roll Olfactory Experience</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the <strong>Xerjoff Blends Rock Edition</strong>, where music and fragrance collide in an electrifying tribute to Black Sabbath’s legendary guitarist, <strong>Tony Iommi</strong>. Just as Iommi revolutionized rock in the late ‘60s, this scent pushes boundaries, delivering a <strong>powerful and rebellious</strong> olfactory masterpiece.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> A bold mix of <strong>Calabrian bergamot, rum, Bulgarian geranium, and passion fruit</strong> sets an intoxicating and energetic opening.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Rich <strong>cinnamon, patchouli from Singapore, and leather</strong> add depth, warmth, and a touch of mystery.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Luxurious <strong>Australian sandalwood, vanilla, caramel, labdanum, and musk</strong> create a long-lasting, sensual finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspired by a Rock Legend</strong> – Created in collaboration with Tony Iommi, capturing the essence of his music and style.<br>\n</li>\n<li> <strong>A Unique Sensory Journey</strong> – A blend of dark, rich notes with bold contrasts, embodying rock ‘n’ roll spirit.<br>\n</li>\n<li> <strong>Luxurious &amp; Gothic Design</strong> – Housed in a sleek, dark bottle that reflects its rebellious and sophisticated nature.<br>\n</li>\n<li> <strong>Exclusive &amp; Rare</strong> – Available only online and at selected retailers.</li>\n<li>Unleash your inner rockstar with <strong>Tony Iommi Monkey Special by Xerjoff</strong> – a fragrance as <strong>bold, intense, and legendary</strong> as the man himself.</li>\n</ul>","tom-ford-tobacco-vanille-eau-de-parfum-50ml":"<p><strong>Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille Eau de Parfum</strong><br><strong>Opulent. Warm. Iconic.</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the world of timeless luxury with <em>Tobacco Vanille</em>—a bold and sensual fragrance inspired by the atmosphere of exclusive private clubs. Rich, spicy, and unmistakably sophisticated, this scent is a signature of confidence and refined taste.</p>\n<p><strong>Fragrance Profile:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Top Notes:</strong><br>A captivating opening of <strong>tobacco leaf</strong> and <strong>spicy ginger</strong> draws you in with warmth and depth, setting the tone for a truly indulgent experience. </p>\n<p><strong>Heart Notes:</strong><br>A luxurious blend of <strong>tonka bean</strong>, <strong>rich spices</strong>, and <strong>creamy cocoa</strong> creates a velvety heart—seductive and comforting all at once. </p>\n<p><strong>Base Notes:</strong><br>The scent lingers with sweet, resinous <strong>wood sap</strong> and dried <strong>fruits</strong>, leaving a lasting impression of richness and mystery. </p>\n<p><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Bold Signature:</strong> Unapologetically rich and complex—perfect for those who want to stand out</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Evening Elegance:</strong> Ideal for upscale events, intimate dinners, or chilly nights</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Warm &amp; Alluring:</strong> Balances sweet and smoky elements for a deeply comforting scent</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Genderless Appeal:</strong> A modern unisex classic embraced by fragrance lovers worldwide</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Olfactory Family:</strong> Oriental · Spicy · Gourmand<br><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Tobacco Leaf · Ginger · Spices · Tonka Bean · Cocoa · Dried Fruits<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>For:</strong> Women &amp; Men</p>","creed-original-vetiver-eau-de-parfum-50ml":"<p>Immerse yourself in the crisp, green sophistication of <strong>Creed Original Vetiver</strong>, a fragrance that elevates the classic essence of vetiver into a modern masterpiece. Perfectly balanced and invigorating, this Eau de Parfum brings freshness, elegance, and refinement to every moment.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Notes</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> A bright burst of bergamot, mandarin, and bitter orange introduces an uplifting citrus medley.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> Coriander and vetiver leaf lend a fresh, spicy heart, seamlessly blending energy and nature.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Warm sandalwood, ambergris, and sensual musk provide a smooth, lingering finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why Choose Creed Original Vetiver?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Uniquely Crafted:</strong> Unlike traditional vetiver scents, this fragrance incorporates the entire plant for an unparalleled green aroma.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Elegant Versatility:</strong> Perfect for any season or occasion, it suits casual outings and formal events alike.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Luxury in Every Detail:</strong> Presented in a beautifully designed 50ml bottle, this scent embodies Creed's timeless craftsmanship.</li>\n</ul>","paul-mitchell-awapuhi-texturizing-sea-spray":"<p><b>A texturizing spray</b> that creates <span><b>tousled beach waves</b></span> while adding <span><b>volume, body and texture</b></span> with natural movement.<br>The surf-inspired formula gives hair a just-off-the-beach look, while Hawaiian awapuhi extract helps maintain moisture balance and leaves hair looking healthy</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types, especially fine and medium hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creates tousled beach waves</li>\n<li>Adds body, volume and texture</li>\n<li>Leaves hair with touchable movement</li>\n<li>Helps maintain moisture balance</li>\n<li>Leaves hair looking healthy </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Spray onto damp hair and style with fingers. Allow to air dry naturally or use a diffuser. Can also be used on dry hair for extra volume and texture</p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p><b>Hand-harvested awapuhi extract</b> in Texturizing Sea Spray helps maintain moisture balance, while the lightweight texturizing formula creates <span><b>beachy waves</b></span> and adds <span><b>body, volume and texture</b></span> with touchable movement<b></b></p>","paul-mitchell-curl-quick-slip-styling-cream":"<p><b>A lightweight styling care cream</b> that creates a <span><b>soft, natural shape</b></span> for waves and curls.<br>It helps <span><b>reduce drying time</b></span>, leaving hair smooth, soft and manageable. The lightweight formula delivers clean texture and flexible hold without weighing hair down</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For curly and wavy hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps reduce drying time</li>\n<li>Helps create beautiful, conditioned waves and curls</li>\n<li>Delivers clean texture and soft, flexible hold</li>\n<li>Leaves hair smooth, soft and manageable</li>\n<li>Lightweight formula won’t weigh hair down </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply a small amount to clean damp hair. Style as desired. Perfect for enhancing curls and creating textured ends</p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The lightweight conditioning formula in Quick Slip Styling Cream helps <span><b>reduce drying time</b></span>, create <span><b>soft, flexible hold</b></span> and leave waves and curls smooth, soft and easy to manage<strong></strong></p>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-clear-jelly-mask":"<p><b>A lightweight gel hair mask</b> that provides <span><b>gentle hydration</b></span>, improves manageability and <span><b>adds natural shine</b></span>.<br>The minimalist formula contains <span><b>only 8 carefully selected ingredients</b></span>. Dermatologist- and pediatrician-tested, free from fragrances and colorants. Moisturizes hair without weighing it down and is suitable for sensitive scalp</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides gentle hydration</li>\n<li>Improves manageability</li>\n<li>Adds natural shine</li>\n<li>Contains only 8 carefully selected ingredients</li>\n<li>Fragrance-free and colorant-free</li>\n<li>Suitable for sensitive scalp</li>\n<li>Lightweight formula won’t weigh hair down</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply to clean towel-dried hair after using <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clear Essential Shampoo</a>. Leave on for 5–15 minutes, then rinse. Use as needed for extra hydration. For best results, use together with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clear Essential Conditioner</a> and <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-styling-glaze\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clear Styling Glaze</a> or <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-smoothing-serum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smoothing Serum</a></p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The minimalist formula in Clear Jelly Mask contains <span><b>8 carefully selected ingredients</b></span> to help <span><b>gently hydrate</b></span> hair, improve manageability and add natural shine without weighing it down, while remaining suitable for sensitive scalp<b></b></p>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-clear-smoothing-serum":"<p><b>A lightweight styling primer serum</b> that <span><b>speeds up drying time</b></span>, <span><b>smooths hair</b></span> and <span><b>reduces frizz</b></span> while adding shine and softness.<br>The minimalist formula contains <span><b>only 3 carefully selected ingredients</b></span>. Dermatologist- and pediatrician-tested, free from fragrances and colorants. Suitable for sensitive scalp and provides professional results without weighing the hair down</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Speeds up drying time</li>\n<li>Smooths hair and helps reduce frizz</li>\n<li>Adds shine and softness</li>\n<li>Contains only 3 carefully selected ingredients</li>\n<li>Fragrance-free and colorant-free</li>\n<li>Suitable for sensitive scalp</li>\n<li>Lightweight formula won’t weigh hair down </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply to damp or dry hair and style as desired. For best results, use after <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clear Essential Shampoo</a> and <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clear Essential Conditioner</a></p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The minimalist formula in Clear Smoothing Serum contains <span><b>3 carefully selected ingredients</b></span> to help <span><b>smooth hair</b></span>, <span><b>reduce frizz</b></span> and add shine without weighing hair down, while remaining suitable for sensitive scalp<b></b></p>","paul-mitchell-clear-essential-conditioner":"<p><b>A gentle conditioner</b> that leaves hair <span><b>light, soft and manageable</b></span>, ideal for <span><b>sensitive scalp</b></span>.<br>The minimalist formula contains <span><b>only 9 carefully selected ingredients</b></span>. Dermatologist- and pediatrician-tested, free from fragrances and colorants. Conditions the hair without irritating the scalp and skin</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For all hair types, especially sensitive scalp</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Leaves hair light, soft and manageable</li>\n<li>Conditions without irritating sensitive scalp and skin</li>\n<li>Contains only 9 carefully selected ingredients</li>\n<li>Fragrance-free and colorant-free</li>\n<li>Gentle enough for daily use</li>\n<li>Suitable for color-treated hair </li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Wash hair with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\">Clear Essential Shampoo</a>. Apply a small amount to clean damp hair, massage, and rinse</p>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b></p>\n<p>The minimalist formula in Clear Essential Conditioner contains <span><b>9 carefully selected ingredients</b></span> to help <span><b>condition hair gently</b></span> and leave it <span><b>light, soft and manageable</b></span> without irritating sensitive scalp and skin<strong></strong></p>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-clear-essential-shampoo":"<p><b>A gentle shampoo</b> that delicately cleanses the hair and scalp, ideal for <span><b>sensitive skin</b></span>.<br>The minimalist formula contains <span><b>only 8 carefully selected ingredients</b></span>. Dermatologist- and pediatrician-tested, free from fragrances and colorants. Effectively cleanses without irritating the scalp. Also suitable for color-treated hair</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types, especially sensitive scalp</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently cleanses hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Helps cleanse without irritating the scalp</li>\n<li>Contains only 8 carefully selected ingredients</li>\n<li>Fragrance-free and colorant-free</li>\n<li>Suitable for color-treated hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong></p>\n<p>Apply to wet hair, gently lather, and rinse thoroughly. For best results, use together with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-clear-essential-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\">Clear Essential Conditioner</a></p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<p>The minimalist formula in Clear Essential Shampoo contains <span><b>8 carefully selected ingredients</b></span> to help <span><b>gently cleanse</b></span> hair and scalp <span><b>without irritating the scalp</b></span>, while keeping hair fresh and comfortable</p>\n<ul></ul>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-curl-hydrating-foam":"<p><b>A moisturizing foam</b> that enhances curl shape and <span><b>protects hair from heat damage</b></span>.<br>The nourishing formula helps reduce frizz and <span><b>protects hair from humidity and heat</b></span>. Jojoba oil, rice protein and a macadamia-derived conditioner help moisturize hair, leaving curls soft, healthy-looking and fuller-looking</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for curly and very coarse hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b>Benefits: </b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides curl memory and shine</li>\n<li>Helps protect hair from heat damage</li>\n<li>Helps reduce frizz and protect against humidity</li>\n<li>Leaves curls soft, healthy-looking and full of body</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Shake well before use. Apply evenly to damp or dry hair. Style as desired. If needed, use together with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-curl-refreshing-mist\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refreshing Mist</a> to refresh curls</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Ingredients: </strong></p>\n<p>Jojoba, rice protein and a macadamia-derived conditioner in Hydrating Foam help moisturize and protect curls, while the nourishing foam helps reduce frizz and support soft, shiny, fuller-looking hair</p>","paul-mitchell-curl-refreshing-mist":"<p><strong>A lightweight refreshing spray</strong> for the scalp and hair, ideal for braids, dreadlocks, and protective hairstyles.<br>The formula with witch hazel extract gently cleanses and <span><b>refreshes the scalp</b></span>, while a nourishing complex of jojoba oil, rice protein, aloe, and a macadamia derivative <span><b>moisturizes hair</b></span> and <span><b>reduces frizz</b></span></p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for curly and very coarse hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits: </b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Refreshes the scalp and hair</li>\n<li>Helps nourish braids, locs and protective styles</li>\n<li>Helps reduce frizz</li>\n<li>Lightweight formula won’t weigh hair down</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Spray onto the scalp for refreshment. Apply to dry braids and dreadlocks for nourishment. Can be used on damp hair before styling. For best results, use together with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-curl-hydrating-foam\" target=\"_blank\">Hydrating Foam</a></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Ingredients: </strong></p>\n<p>Witch hazel in Refreshing Mist helps refresh the scalp, while jojoba oil, rice protein, aloe and a macadamia-derived conditioner help moisturize hair, reduce frizz and improve manageability</p>","paul-mitchell-curl-twirl-around-cream-serum":"<p>A <strong>dual-phase cream serum</strong> that enhances, separates, and <strong>defines curls</strong> <strong>and waves</strong> <strong>without frizz or stiffness</strong>.<br>The combination of a moisturizing cream and smoothing serum creates soft, elastic, and shiny curls that do not become stiff after drying. Helps maintain curl shape and bounce throughout the day</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for curly and wavy hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits: </b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b></b>Defines, separates and enhances curls and waves</li>\n<li><span>Helps control frizz without stiffness or crunch</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>Creates a soft, touchable finish</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span>Helps curls keep their shape and bounce all day long</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply a small amount to clean damp hair. For more defined curls, twist strands around your finger. Allow hair to air dry naturally or use a diffuser</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Ingredients: </strong></p>\n<p>Jojoba oil, shea butter, babassu oil and panthenol in Twirl Around Cream Serum help hydrate and soften curls, while the dual cream-serum formula smooths frizz and leaves waves and curls defined, separated and touchable</p>","paul-mitchell-curl-full-circle-leave-in-cream":"<p>A lightweight <strong>leave-in conditioning cream</strong> that <strong>moisturizes</strong> and nourishes <strong>every curl</strong> without weighing the hair down.<br>The formula helps detangle hair, <strong>reduces frizz</strong>, and protects against damage. Hair becomes soft, elastic, and maintains natural movement</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for curly and wavy hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps replenish every curl</li>\n<li><span>Detangles, tames frizz and hydrates hair</span></li>\n<li><span>Lightweight formula won’t weigh curly hair down</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<p>Apply to clean damp hair and style as desired.<br>To refresh the style on the second day, lightly dampen the hair before application</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong>A smoothing, detangling lightweight conditioner in Full Circle Leave-In Cream helps replenish every curl, while the creamy formula hydrates hair, tames frizz and leaves curls soft and touchable<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-curl-round-trip-defining-serum":"<p>A <strong>lightweight serum</strong> that helps style wavy and curly hair faster, giving it <strong>defined shape and flexible hold</strong>.<br><strong>Reduces drying time</strong>, making curls bouncy, well-defined, and movable. Panthenol and minerals care for the hair, strengthen it, and help protect against damage.</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for wavy and curly hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits: </b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides flexible hold for bouncy, defined waves and curls</li>\n<li>Helps condition, protect and strengthen wavy and curly hair</li>\n<li>Helps reduce styling time</li>\n<li>Leaves curls touchable and defined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply to damp hair to create defined waves and curls. Style as desired</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Ingredients: </strong></p>\n<p>Panthenol and minerals in Round Trip Defining Serum help condition, protect and strengthen wavy and curly hair, while the lightweight liquid formula provides flexible hold for bouncy, defined curls</p>","paul-mitchell-extra-body-daily-shampoo":"<p>A volumizing shampoo ideal for fine hair that gently cleanses, builds body and improves manageability.<strong> Paul Mitchell Extra-Body Shampoo</strong> helps create thicker, fuller-looking hair while leaving strands silky-smooth and easy to style.</p>\n<p>Formulated with<strong> panthenol and wheat-derived ingredients</strong>, it helps boost body, protect strands and improve shine while supporting softer, more manageable hair.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fine hair \n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently cleanses and adds volume<br>\n</li>\n<li>Helps build body and fullness<br>\n</li>\n<li>Improves manageability<br>\n</li>\n<li>Helps repair damage<br>\n</li>\n<li>Leaves hair silky-smooth and shiny<br>\n</li>\n<li>Color-safe formula<br>\n</li>\n<li>Vegan<br>\n</li>\n<li>Paraben-free \n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>87% More Volume*</strong></p>\n<p>*When using Extra-Body Shampoo and Conditioner, as compared to untreated hair. Results based on testing by an independent, third-party laboratory. <strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong></p>\n<p>Massage into wet hair. Rinse. Repeat as needed. Follow with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-forever-blonde-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\">Extra-Body Conditioner</a>. </p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<p>Panthenol in Extra-Body Shampoo helps boost body and support damaged hair, while wheat-derived ingredients help protect strands and leave hair silky-smooth.<b></b></p>\n<ul></ul>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-forever-blonde-conditioner":"<p>A volumizing conditioner ideal for fine hair that gently conditions, detangles and adds body. <strong>Paul Mitchell Extra-Body Conditioner </strong>helps create thicker, fuller-looking hair while leaving strands silky-smooth and easy to manage.</p>\n<p>Formulated with <strong>panthenol and wheat-derived ingredients</strong>, it helps boost body, support damaged hair and protect strands while improving smoothness and shine.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fine hair \n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently conditions and adds volume<br>\n</li>\n<li>Detangles and improves manageability<br>\n</li>\n<li>Helps build body and fullness<br>\n</li>\n<li>Helps support damaged hair<br>\n</li>\n<li>Leaves hair silky-smooth and shiny<br>\n</li>\n<li>Color-safe formula<br>\n</li>\n<li>Vibrant, crisp apple scent \n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>87% More Volume*</strong></p>\n<p>*When using Extra-Body Shampoo and Conditioner, as compared to untreated hair. Results based on testing by an independent, third-party laboratory. </p>\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong></p>\n<p>After shampooing, apply to clean, damp hair. Rinse thoroughly. For best results, use with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-extra-body-daily-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Extra-Body Shampoo</a>.<b></b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>Panthenol in Extra-Body Conditioner helps boost body and support damaged hair, while wheat-derived ingredients help protect strands and leave hair silky-smooth.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-forever-blonde-shampoo":"<p>A repairing shampoo designed for bleached and lightened hair. <b>Forever Blonde Shampoo</b> gently cleanses while helping to repair damage and maintain a bright, radiant blonde tone.</p>\n<p>This sulfate-free formula (free from SLS, SLES, ALS) is enriched with <b>vegan KerActive protein and a blend of botanicals</b> to deeply nourish, strengthen, and keep blonde hair light, vibrant, and healthy.</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bleached and lightened hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently cleanses lightened hair</li>\n<li>Helps repair damage</li>\n<li>Maintains bright, clean blonde tones</li>\n<li>Deeply nourishes and strengthens</li>\n<li>Sulfate-free formula</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Massage into wet hair and rinse. Repeat if needed. Follow with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-forever-blonde-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\">Forever Blonde Conditioner</a> for best results.</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br><span>Vegan KerActive protein and a special blend of botanicals in Forever Blonde Shampoo help nourish bleached and lightened hair, while the sulfate-free formula gently cleanses and helps keep blonde hair light, bright and healthy-looking.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-mitch-double-hitter-2-in-1-shampoo-conditioner":"<p>A convenient 2-in-1 formula that cleanses and conditions in one easy step. <b>Double Hitter</b> is specially designed for men, delivering a rich lather while leaving hair clean, soft, and healthy-looking.</p>\n<p>Conditioning agents improve detangling and provide a light, natural finish without weighing hair down. Perfect for a quick and effective daily routine.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shampoo and conditioner in one</li>\n<li>Saves time and simplifies routine</li>\n<li>Cleanses and softens hair</li>\n<li>Improves detangling</li>\n<li>Leaves hair full and fresh</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Apply to hair, lather, massage, and rinse. Done!</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<strong>Ingredients:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div>Conditioning ingredients in Double Hitter 2-in-1 Shampoo &amp; Conditioner help improve detangling and leave hair with a soft, light finish, while the rich lather washes and conditions in one easy step.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-awapuhi-wild-ginger-repair-cream-rinse":"<p>A deeply moisturizing conditioner designed to instantly improve the look and feel of dry, damaged hair. <b>Cream Rinse </b>detangles, hydrates, and leaves hair soft, smooth, and healthy-looking.</p>\n<p>Infused with <b>Hawaiian awapuhi extract</b>, it delivers moisture and shine, while <b>KeraTriplex® keratin protein technology</b> helps strengthen, repair, and protect hair from damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry, damaged and color-treated hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instantly detangles and softens hair</li>\n<li>Deeply hydrates and nourishes</li>\n<li>Strengthens and repairs hair</li>\n<li>Adds smoothness and shine</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Apply generously from roots to ends, massage, and rinse thoroughly. For best results, use with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-awapuhi-shampoo-1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Nourishing Shampoo</a>.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong><strong></strong>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">Hand-harvested awapuhi extract in Cream Rinse helps soften hair and add shine, while KeraTriplex® keratin protein technology helps strengthen, replenish and protect dry, thirsty strands for silky, healthy-looking results.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-awapuhi-shampoo-1":"<p>A luxurious, nourishing shampoo designed to restore dry and damaged hair. <b>Nourishing Shampoo</b> gently cleanses while protecting color and helping to repair hair for a softer, stronger, and healthier look.</p>\n<p>This sulfate-free formula (free from SLS, SLES, ALS) features <b>hand-harvested awapuhi extract</b> to balance moisture and enhance manageability and shine, while <b>KeraTriplex® keratin protein technology</b> helps rebuild and strengthen every strand.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry, damaged and color-treated hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gently cleanses and repairs hair</li>\n<li>Deeply nourishes and hydrates</li>\n<li>Protects color-treated hair</li>\n<li>Strengthens and improves hair structure</li>\n<li>Gentle enough for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Massage into wet hair and rinse. For best results, follow with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-awapuhi-wild-ginger-repair-cream-rinse\" target=\"_blank\">Cream Rinse</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <span>Hand-harvested awapuhi extract in Nourishing Shampoo helps balance moisture for manageability and shine, while KeraTriplex® keratin protein technology helps replenish every strand for healthy-looking hair.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-super-smooth-shampoo":"<p>A smoothing shampoo designed for daily care of frizzy, unruly hair. <b>Super Smooth Shampoo</b> gently cleanses while helping to reduce frizz and improve manageability for smoother, more controlled hair.</p>\n<p>This sulfate-free formula (free from SLS, SLES, ALS) is enriched with <b>plant-derived squalane</b> to help tame frizz, enhance softness, and boost shine.</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Frizzy hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smooths hair and reduces frizz</li>\n<li>Improves manageability</li>\n<li>Gently cleanses without stripping</li>\n<li>Sulfate-free (SLS, SLES, ALS free)</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Massage into wet hair and rinse. Repeat if needed. Follow with Super Skinny Conditioner for best results.</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br><span>Plant-derived squalane in Super Smooth Shampoo helps reduce frizz and improve manageability, while the daily smoothing formula leaves hair feeling softer, smoother and easier to control.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-super-smooth-conditioner":"<p>A smoothing conditioner designed for daily care of frizzy, unruly hair. <b>Super Smooth Conditioner</b> softens, smooths, and improves manageability, making hair easier to control and style.</p>\n<p>Enriched with <b>plant-derived squalane</b>, it helps reduce frizz, enhance softness, and provide lightweight hydration without weighing hair down.</p>\n<p><b>Hair Type:</b> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Frizzy hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smooths hair and reduces frizz</li>\n<li>Softens and improves manageability</li>\n<li>Lightweight, non-weighing formula</li>\n<li>Enhances styling control</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>After cleansing with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-super-smooth-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\">Super Smooth Shampoo</a>, apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Rinse thoroughly.</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br><span>Plant-derived squalane in Super Smooth Conditioner helps reduce frizz and improve manageability, while the daily smoothing formula softens texture and leaves hair feeling smoother and more controlled.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-sheer-hydration-shampoo":"<p>Restore moisture and shine to dry, dehydrated hair with <b>Paul Mitchell Sheer Hydration Shampoo</b>. This hydrating formula gently cleanses while delivering essential moisture, leaving hair soft, smooth, and healthy-looking.</p>\n<p>Enriched with <b>Irish sea moss and spirulina</b>, it helps revive dry strands, improve elasticity, and boost natural shine.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry hair\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deep hydration for dry hair</li>\n<li>Leaves hair soft, smooth, and manageable</li>\n<li>Enhances natural shine</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p>93% reported softer-looking hair*<br>91% reported healthier-looking hair*</p>\n<p>*Based on a 49-person consumer study</p>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Apply to wet hair, massage, and rinse thoroughly. Follow with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-sheer-hydration-conditioner?_pos=1&amp;_sid=bd58a92dc&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\">Sheer Hydration Conditioner</a> for best results.<strong></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br>Irish sea moss and spirulina in Sheer Hydration Shampoo help hydrate and revive dry hair, while the moisturizing formula boosts shine and leaves strands feeling soft and healthy.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-conditioner-1":"<p>An invigorating conditioner that refreshes the scalp while softening and smoothing hair. <b>Tea Tree Special Conditioner </b>instantly detangles, improves manageability, and leaves hair feeling soft, fresh, and healthy.</p>\n<p>Formulated with a botanical blend and the signature <b>Tingle Complex (tea tree, peppermint, and lavender)</b>, it delivers hydration while providing a cooling, tingling sensation on the scalp.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instantly detangles and smooths hair</li>\n<li>Softens and improves manageability</li>\n<li>Refreshes and invigorates the scalp</li>\n<li>Leaves hair soft and healthy-looking</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b>How to use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Massage and rinse thoroughly. For best results, use with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-tea-tree-lavender-mint-shampoo?_pos=1&amp;_sid=bc5381d58&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Green Tea Tree Special Shampoo</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<p>Tea tree, peppermint and lavender in Tea Tree Special Conditioner help refresh the scalp, while the moisturizing botanical blend softens, smooths and helps detangle hair for instant manageability.<br></p>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-sheer-hydration-conditioner":"<p>Deliver deep hydration and care to dry, dehydrated hair. This conditioner replenishes moisture, leaving hair soft, smooth, and visibly healthier.</p>\n<p>Infused with Irish sea moss and spirulina, it helps revive dry strands, enhance natural shine, and protect against damage and breakage.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry hair\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deep hydration</li>\n<li>Soft, silky hair</li>\n<li>Enhanced shine</li>\n<li>Helps prevent damage</li>\n<li>Suitable for regular use</li>\n</ul>\n<p>93% reported softer-looking hair*<br>91% reported healthier-looking hair*</p>\n<p>*Based on a 49-person consumer study</p>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>After <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-sheer-hydration-shampoo?_pos=1&amp;_sid=33e8013a5&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\">shampooing</a>, apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Leave briefly, then rinse thoroughly.<strong></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br>Irish sea moss and spirulina in Sheer Hydration Conditioner help hydrate and revive dry hair, while the moisturizing formula boosts shine and helps leave strands soft, healthy-looking and more resilient.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-color-protect-conditioner":"<p>A color-protecting conditioner designed to extend the life and vibrancy of color-treated hair. <b>Color Protect Conditioner </b>hydrates, detangles, and helps strengthen hair while protecting it from color fading.</p>\n<p>Enriched with <b>sunflower extract</b>, it helps defend against sun-induced color fading while leaving hair soft, shiny, and healthy-looking.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Color-treated hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps extend color longevity</li>\n<li>Hydrates and detangles hair</li>\n<li>Strengthens and reduces breakage</li>\n<li>Enhances shine and softness</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>After cleansing with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-color-protect-shampoo?_pos=1&amp;_sid=fa671bfd1&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Color Protect Shampoo</a>, apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Rinse thoroughly and style as desired.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Sunflower extract in Color Protect Conditioner helps protect hair from color-fading sun damage, while the daily conditioning formula detangles and helps strengthen strands.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-color-protect-shampoo":"<p>A color-protecting shampoo designed to extend the life and vibrancy of color-treated hair. <b>Color Protect Shampoo</b> gently cleanses while helping to prevent color fading and protect hair from environmental damage.</p>\n<p>Enriched with <b>sunflower extract</b>, it helps shield hair from sun-induced color fading while enhancing shine for healthy-looking, radiant hair.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Color-treated hair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps extend color longevity</li>\n<li>Protects against fading and dullness</li>\n<li>Gently cleanses color-treated hair</li>\n<li>Enhances shine and vibrancy</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Massage into wet hair and rinse. Repeat if needed. Follow with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-color-protect-conditioner?_pos=2&amp;_sid=fa671bfd1&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Color Protect Conditioner</a> for best results.</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Ingredients:</strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Sunflower extract in Color Protect Shampoo helps shield hair from color-fading sun damage, while the gentle formula helps cleanse color-treated hair and boost shine for vibrant, healthy-looking results.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-awapuhi-conditioner":"<p>The perfect match to the iconic <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-awapuhi-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Awapuhi Shampoo</a>. <b>Paul Mitchell Awapuhi Conditioner</b> hydrates, smooths, and softens hair, leaving it silky, shiny, and healthy-looking.</p>\n<p>Infused with <b>Hawaiian awapuhi extract</b> harvested from Paul Mitchell<span>’</span>s own farm, this lightweight formula delivers moisture without weighing hair down.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hydrates and softens hair</li>\n<li>Leaves hair smooth and shiny</li>\n<li>Lightweight, non-weighing formula</li>\n<li>Perfectly pairs with Awapuhi Shampoo</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>After cleansing with Awapuhi Shampoo, apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Rinse thoroughly and style as desired.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div><span>Hawaiian awapuhi in Awapuhi Conditioner helps deliver moisture and softness, while the lightweight formula leaves hair smooth, shiny and manageable.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-awapuhi-shampoo":"<p>A legendary best-selling shampoo from Paul Mitchell that delivers clean, fresh, and shiny hair. Infused with <b>Hawaiian awapuhi</b>, this gentle formula effectively cleanses, removes dulling buildup, and enhances natural shine without drying out the hair.</p>\n<p>Suitable for daily use, it helps maintain color vibrancy while leaving hair soft, fresh, and manageable.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Especially fine and static-prone hair</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Thoroughly cleanses hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Removes buildup and boosts shine</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Color-safe formula</li>\n<li>Can be used as a body wash</li>\n</ul>\n<p>#1 best-selling Paul Mitchell shampoo*</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">*Based on 2024 sales data<strong></strong></p>\n<div>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>How to Use:</strong></p>\n<p>Massage into wet hair, then rinse. Repeat if needed. Follow with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-awapuhi-conditioner?_pos=1&amp;_sid=15df209b1&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Awapuhi Conditioner</a> for best results.</p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Hawaiian awapuhi in Awapuhi Shampoo helps hydrate strands and improve manageability, while the lush lather removes dulling buildup and boosts shine.<strong></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-tea-tree-lavender-mint-shampoo":"<p>A cult-favorite, invigorating shampoo that refreshes the scalp and leaves hair clean, shiny, and full of vitality. <b>Tea Tree Special Shampoo</b> deeply cleanses while delivering a cooling, tingling sensation for an energizing start to your day.</p>\n<p>Formulated with the signature <b>Tingle Complex (tea tree, peppermint, and lavender)</b>, it stimulates the scalp, removes impurities, and provides a refreshing, clean feel.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply cleanses hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Refreshes and invigorates the scalp</li>\n<li>Adds shine and vitality</li>\n<li>Suitable for daily use</li>\n<li>Cooling, tingling sensation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>#1 best-selling tea tree shampoo*<br>#1 scalp care shampoo sold in salons*</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Apply to damp hair, lather, and rinse thoroughly. Follow with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-conditioner-1?_pos=1&amp;_sid=67fecbb5d&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Green Tea Tree Special Conditioner</a> for best results.</p>\n<p><strong></strong><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong><span>Moisture-rich conditioners and amino acids in Lavender Mint Moisturizing Shampoo help improve strength, shine and manageability, while lavender, mint and tea tree help leave hair feeling soft, replenished and refreshed.</span><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-shampoo-two":"<p>A deep-cleansing clarifying shampoo designed to remove buildup and excess oil. <b>Shampoo Two</b> thoroughly cleanses hair, leaving it fresh, lightweight, and full of body.</p>\n<p>Ideal for oily hair, this color-safe formula helps extend freshness while maintaining shine and volume without over-drying.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All hair types</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Especially oily hair</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply cleanses hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Removes excess oil and product buildup</li>\n<li>Leaves hair fresh, light, and full of body</li>\n<li>Enhances shine</li>\n<li>Color-safe formula<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><b>How to Use:</b></p>\n<p>Massage into wet hair and rinse. Repeat if needed. For best results, follow with a deep conditioner or treatment.</p>\n<p><strong></strong><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></p>\n<p>Panthenol and glycerin in Shampoo Two help leave hair feeling fresh and clean, while citrus peel oil contributes to the formula’s crisp, energizing scent.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-conditioner":"<p>A hydrating conditioner designed to soothe both hair and senses. <b>Lavender Mint Moisturizing Conditioner</b> moisturizes, detangles, and softens dry, coarse hair while improving manageability.</p>\n<p>Its ultra-rich formula helps hydrate strands, prevent dryness and split ends, and leave hair smooth and silky. The calming blend of lavender, mint, and tea tree creates a relaxing, spa-like experience.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Coarse and dry hair\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply hydrates dry hair</li>\n<li>Detangles and softens</li>\n<li>Improves manageability</li>\n<li>Helps prevent split ends</li>\n<li>Provides a calming aromatherapy experience</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Apply a small amount to clean, damp hair. Massage and rinse thoroughly. For best results, use with <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-shampoo\" target=\"_blank\">Lavender Mint Moisturizing Shampoo</a>.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><strong></strong>Ultra-rich conditioners in Lavender Mint Moisturizing Conditioner help detangle, hydrate and improve manageability, while lavender, mint and tea tree leave hair feeling soft and comforted and create a calming aromatherapy-inspired experience.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-shampoo":"<p>A hydrating shampoo designed to replenish dry, coarse hair while soothing the senses. <b>Lavender Mint Moisturizing Shampoo</b> gently cleanses, restores moisture, and improves softness, shine, and manageability.</p>\n<p>Formulated with moisture-rich conditioners and amino acids, it helps strengthen hair while delivering a calming, spa-like experience. The relaxing blend of lavender, mint, and tea tree soothes both hair and mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Hair Type:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Coarse and dry hair\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Benefits:</b><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply hydrates dry hair</li>\n<li>Softens and smooths</li>\n<li>Improves shine and manageability</li>\n<li>Strengthens hair</li>\n<li>Provides a relaxing aromatherapy experience</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div>Apply to damp hair, lather, and rinse. For best results, follow with <a href=\"https://rempireshop.com/products/paul-mitchell-tea-tree-special-conditioner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tea Tree Lavender Mint Moisturizing Conditioner</a>.</div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients:</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Moisture-rich conditioners and amino acids in Lavender Mint Moisturizing Shampoo help improve strength, shine and manageability, while lavender, mint and tea tree help leave hair feeling soft, replenished and refreshed.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","byredo-blanche-body-wash-225-ml-for-women":"<p><strong>Byredo Blanche Body Wash</strong> is a gentle cleansing body wash that embodies a sense of purity, simplicity, and natural elegance. This fragrance captures the beauty of clean skin, transparency, and intimate everyday rituals.</p>\n<p>Light notes of aldehydes and rose open with a fresh, airy character, leading into a soft floral heart of peony and violet. The base of musk and sandalwood adds warmth and depth, evoking the comforting sensation of freshly laundered linen and clean skin.</p>\n<p>The mild, moisturising formula delicately cleanses the skin without drying it out, leaving it soft, comfortable, and lightly scented. Perfect for daily use and an ideal base layer for <strong>Byredo Blanche Eau de Parfum</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Gentle cleansing</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Moisturising formula</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Elegant, clean fragrance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Perfect base layer for fragrance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Suitable for daily use</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>High-quality ingredients</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Paraben-free</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","kevin-murphy-night-shift-100ml":"<h3><strong>HYDRATING OVERNIGHT SERUM</strong></h3>\n<p>Slip into bed with <strong>NIGHT.SHIFT</strong>, a deeply replenishing overnight serum powered by Hyaluronic Acid and antioxidant-rich Australian Kakadu Plum. This leave-in treatment delivers up to <strong>12 hours of hydration</strong>*, absorbing into each strand to strengthen and smooth hair while you sleep. Wake up to hair that’s <strong>2x stronger</strong>, effortlessly manageable, and touchably soft. <strong>No rinse required.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Up to <strong>12 hours of overnight hydration</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Shinier, more radiant hair</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reduces frizz by <strong>up to 94%</strong> for <strong>24 hours</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wake up to <strong>2x stronger hair</strong> with less breakage</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Strengthens hair <strong>while you sleep</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>3x smoother</strong>, more manageable hair</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Lightweight formula that <strong>doesn’t weigh hair down</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex-with-print-three-elements-air":"<p><strong> REMPIRE T-shirt “Three Elements” — Japanese Style </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Design by Roman Warwink</strong></p>\n<p>These T-shirts intertwine three powerful elements — <strong>water</strong>, <strong>fire</strong>, and <strong>air</strong>. Each carries its own symbolism: balance, strength, and freedom. The original artwork is inspired by traditional Japanese woodblock prints, featuring dynamic lines and expressive details.</p>\n<ul>\n<li> Original print — exclusive Japanese-style design</li>\n<li><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></li>\n<li><span>Material: 100% cotton</span></li>\n<li><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Elements in every detail:</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Fire</strong> — energy and drive forward<br>💧 <strong>Water</strong> — purity and calm<br>🌬 <strong>Air</strong> — freedom and motion</p>","davines-naturaltech-nourishing-keratin-booster-100ml":"<p><strong>Davines NaturalTech Nourishing Keratin Booster – Intensive Repair for Severely Damaged Hair</strong></p>\n<p>Unleash the power of professional-level care with <em>Davines Nourishing Keratin Booster</em>, a high-performance additive infused with concentrated vegetal keratin. Specially formulated for extremely damaged or chemically treated hair, this advanced booster works in synergy with Keratin Wonder Superactive to restore strength, integrity, and softness to the most compromised strands.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Deep Repair Technology:</strong> Rebuilds broken keratin bonds within the hair fiber for lasting resilience.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Anti-Breakage Shield:</strong> Reinforces the internal structure of the hair, reducing split ends and preventing further damage.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Intensive Nourishment:</strong> Leaves hair soft, smooth, and visibly healthier after just one use.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Free From Harsh Additives:</strong> Formulated without parabens and sulfates for gentle yet powerful results.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Salon-Only Formula:</strong> Designed exclusively for professional in-salon treatments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Use (Professional Only):</strong><br>Mix <em>Keratin Booster Superactive</em> with <em>Keratin Wonder Superactive</em> in a 1:5 ratio. For a standard application, combine 3 pipettes (6g) of Booster with 30g of Wonder Superactive. Apply to towel-dried hair in sections. Leave on for 10 minutes with heat or 15 minutes without heat. Rinse thoroughly. Follow with <em>Vegetarian Miracle Conditioner</em> or <em>Mask</em> based on hair texture.</p>","davines-naturaltech-nourishing-keratin-sealer-100-ml":"<p><strong>Davines NaturalTech Nourishing Keratin Sealer – Strength from Root to Tip</strong></p>\n<p>Elevate your haircare ritual with <em>Davines NaturalTech Nourishing Keratin Sealer</em>, a professional-grade leave-in treatment designed to restore resilience and vitality to all hair types. Infused with antioxidant-rich ingredients, this powerful formula seals the cuticle, smooths the surface, and strengthens hair from within.</p>\n<p><strong>Why You’ll Love It:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Keratin-Infused Formula:</strong> Fortifies the hair structure to reduce breakage and split ends.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Boosts Elasticity:</strong> Improves flexibility and manageability, leaving hair soft and strong.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Seals &amp; Protects:</strong> Smooths the cuticle for enhanced shine and long-lasting moisture retention.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Lightweight &amp; Nourishing:</strong> Leaves no residue—just healthy, radiant hair with every use.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Ideal for All Hair Types:</strong> Whether your hair is fragile, processed, or naturally dry, it delivers targeted care and visible results.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","yumain-numb-serum-instant-pain-relief-for-tattoos":"<p><strong>Instant Pain Relief for Tattoos</strong><br><strong>Numb in Just 1 Minute – Painless &amp; Smooth Tattoo Sessions</strong></p>\n<p>Fast-acting and long-lasting formula designed to numb the skin in just 60 seconds. No redness, no discoloration, and no interference with tattoo colors. Perfect for tattoos, permanent makeup, and piercings.</p>\n<p>Vegan, fragrance-free, and gentle on sensitive skin.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong> </strong><strong>Fast-Acting Formula</strong><br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>No Redness or Discoloration</strong><br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vegan &amp; Sensitive Skin Friendly</strong><br><strong></strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Long-Lasting Comfort</strong><br>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Multipurpose Use</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong> Tattoo-Friendly Ingredients:</strong><br><em>Aqua, Lidocaine Hydrochloride, Dehydroxanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Benzyl Alcohol.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li> 2.02 fl oz / 60 ml</li>\n</ul>","byredo-mojave-ghost-eau-de-parfum-spray-50ml":"<p><strong>Byredo Mojave Ghost Eau de Parfum 50ml – A Hauntingly Beautiful Scent</strong></p>\n<p>Discover the ethereal elegance of <strong>Byredo Mojave Ghost</strong>, a fragrance inspired by the quiet resilience and delicate beauty of the Mojave Desert. Capturing the essence of the rare ghost flower, this scent embodies the contrast between fragility and strength, offering a mesmerizing blend of airy florals and warm, woody undertones.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why You'll Love It:</strong></h3>\n<p> <strong>A Soft Yet Captivating Opening:</strong> Musky ambrette and the exotic sweetness of sapodilla create an inviting first impression.<br> <strong>Delicate Floral Heart:</strong> Magnolia, violet, and creamy sandalwood weave together a graceful, powdery bouquet.<br> <strong>A Lasting, Grounded Finish:</strong> Cedarwood, Chantilly musk, and vetiver add warmth and depth, leaving a refined yet soulful trail.</p>\n<h3><strong>Timeless and Versatile</strong></h3>\n<p>Whether you're drawn to understated luxury or bold individuality, <strong>Mojave Ghost</strong> complements every occasion. Its soft, woody-floral composition lingers beautifully, making it the perfect signature scent for those who embrace both strength and elegance.</p>","yumain-aftercare-washing-foam-expert-care-for-your-tattoos":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Natural Ingredients:</strong> Packed with D-panthenol and hyaluronic acid to soothe and deeply hydrate your skin.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Gentle Cleansing:</strong> Effectively cleanses your tattooed skin, removing excess ink and blood without any discomfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Promotes Healing:</strong> Accelerates your skin’s natural recovery process for quicker, smoother healing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Rich, Long-lasting Foam:</strong> Creates a luxurious foam that’s both gentle and effective in removing impurities.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Moisturizing &amp; Protective:</strong> Keeps your skin moisturized while offering a protective barrier to prevent dryness and irritation.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect for Tattoo Aftercare:</strong> Specifically designed to maintain and protect your tattoos through all stages of healing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Made in Europe:</strong> A high-quality European product, ensuring safety and effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>       With <strong>Yumain Aftercare Washing Foam</strong>, your tattoos will heal more quickly, feel        smoother, and look as vibrant as ever. Treat your skin to the best aftercare available!</p>\n<p><strong>       2.02 fl oz / 60 ml</strong></p>","yumain-tattoo-balm-the-ultimate-care-for-your-tattoos":"<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Nourishing Ingredients:</strong> A carefully curated mix of shea butter, olive, castor, and sunflower oils, enriched with aloe, sea buckthorn, and marigold extracts for intense hydration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Protective Barrier:</strong> Anti-bacterial properties create a shield to keep germs at bay, supporting a clean and safe healing process.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Skin Repair Boost:</strong> Promotes natural regeneration, helping reduce redness, irritation, and discomfort after tattooing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Nutrient-Rich Formula:</strong> Full of essential vitamins, minerals, and amino acids to enhance skin health.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight &amp; Non-Greasy:</strong> Absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving it soft and smooth without any sticky residue.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Natural &amp; Organic:</strong> Made from organic plant extracts, free from harmful chemicals, and suitable for all skin types.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>European-Made Excellence:</strong> Proudly crafted in Europe with a commitment to cruelty-free and sustainable practices.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>       1.69 fl oz / 50 ml</strong></p>","yumain-tattoo-cream":"<h3><strong>Yumain Tattoo Cream 50ml – Premium Care for Your Inked Skin</strong></h3>\n<p>Elevate your tattoo care routine with <strong>Yumain Tattoo Cream</strong>, specially formulated to protect and nourish both new and existing tattoos. Packed with vitamins, antioxidants, and essential oils, this cream is designed to enhance your skin’s natural rejuvenation while keeping your tattoos vibrant.</p>\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Deep Nourishment:</strong> Enriched with vitamins and antioxidants to support skin recovery and maintain tattoo brilliance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Hydration and Comfort:</strong> Provides intense moisture, leaving skin soft, soothed, and irritation-free.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Ingredients:</strong> Made with natural and organic components for a premium skincare experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Gentle for All Skin Types:</strong> Ideal for sensitive, dry, or oily skin, ensuring everyone can enjoy its benefits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cruelty-Free &amp; Ethical:</strong> Produced in Europe, free from animal testing and harmful chemicals.</li>\n</ul>","baccarat-rouge-540-eau-de-parfum-70ml":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Baccarat Rouge 540 Eau de Parfum 70ml – The Essence of Radiant Luxury</strong></p>\n<p>Discover the unparalleled sophistication of <strong>Baccarat Rouge 540</strong>, a fragrance that blends artistry with olfactory perfection. Crafted by Maison Francis Kurkdjian, this Eau de Parfum is a celebration of brilliance, elegance, and timeless allure.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance Profile</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Top Notes:</strong> The delicate sweetness of saffron intertwines with the airy floral charm of jasmine, creating a luminous introduction.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Heart Notes:</strong> A rich ambergris accord adds depth, seamlessly melding with woody nuances for a sensual core.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Notes:</strong> Cedarwood and fir balsam round out the fragrance with a warm, grounding finish.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Why It's Special</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Elegance:</strong> Designed to complement both men and women, its unisex composition is a harmonious balance of strength and softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Long-Lasting Impact:</strong> A luxurious sillage ensures your presence is remembered long after you’ve left.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Iconic Design:</strong> The 70ml bottle reflects timeless luxury, making it a perfect gift or addition to any fragrance collection.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","kilian-unisex-kologne-shield-of-protection-eau-de-parfum-spray-50ml":"<p>Elevate your fragrance collection with <strong>Kilian Kologne Shield Of Protection</strong>, a luxurious unisex Eau de Parfum designed to captivate and protect. Perfectly balanced, this scent opens with vibrant citrus notes that instantly refresh, while its aromatic heart and warm base create a sophisticated and lasting impression.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Choose Kilian Kologne?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect for Everyone:</strong> A versatile unisex fragrance that complements any style or occasion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Quality:</strong> Crafted with the finest ingredients to deliver a long-lasting and elegant aroma.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compact Design:</strong> A sleek 50ml spray bottle that fits effortlessly into your daily routine or travel essentials.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Signature Blend:</strong> Combines freshness with depth, offering an invigorating yet grounding experience.</li>\n</ul>","captain-fawcett-expedition-reserve-matt-styling-and-volumising-hair-powder":"<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>Captain Fawcett's Matt Styling and Volumising Hair Powder provides a beautiful texture and weightless volume with a matt finish. </span></p>\n<div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<div><span><strong>Captain Fawcett's Hair Powder</strong> is suitable for all hair types and washes out easily with warm water. </span></div>\n<div><span>The attractively designed packaging is compact, fully suitable for travelling and simplifies a gentleman's grooming routine, whatever continent he may be travelling to. </span></div>\n<div><span><br></span></div>\n<div><span>The spicy \"Expedition Reserve\" fragrance, composed of exotic patchouli, fresh cedarwood and precious woody notes, is inspired by the rare aromatic oils that Captain Fawcett collected on his travels around the globe. The powder can easily be combined with other products in the range. </span></div>\n<div><span><br></span></div>\n<div><span><strong>Ingredients</strong>: Water (Aqua) (Eau), Silica Silylate, Monopropylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Chlorphenesin, Fragrance (Parfum), Ethyltrimonium Chloride Methacrylate/ Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein Copolymer, Limonene, Eugenol, Linalool</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-re-store":"<h3>RE.STORE</h3>\n<div>\n<div>REPAIRING, CLEANSING TREATMENT FOR DRY, DAMAGED AND OVERPROCESSED HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Repair, renew and restore dry, damaged, frizzy over-processed hair with RE.STORE, the third step in our 4-part system for intense repair. Our potent, cleansing and repairing treatment is bursting with the goodness of powerful superfood proteins and fruit enzymes that work to naturally bind moisture to help reconstruct damaged hair. With the help of amino acids, the building blocks of repair, RE.STORE helps to rebuild and restore hair’s elasticity strength and moisture levels.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Non-foaming, cleansing and repairing treatment</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A power-packed blend of proteins and enzymes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Helps nourish, restore and replenish the hair</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Helps hair look and feel smoother and stronger</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enhances manageability and shine</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ideal for all hair types in need of targeted repair</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>HOW TO APPLY:<br>APPLY. RESTORE. RINSE</strong>. For optimal repairing results, use 1-2 times per week as a substitute for shampoo and conditioner and as part of our 4-part system from the <strong>REPAIR </strong>regimen.</p>\n<p><em>Note:</em>  You might not need to wash your hair daily, but remember to always use <strong>REPAIR-ME.WASH</strong> and <strong>RINSE</strong> for two consecutive washes even if they are apart, and then replace both with <strong>RE.STORE</strong> for the third wash.</p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS:</strong><br>A powerful natural enzyme, <strong><em>Papain</em></strong> is from the Papaya and is known to help unlock and boost the potency of other ingredients that work to bind moisture, and improve hair’s overall elasticity.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Bromelain</em></strong> is an enzyme from the Pineapple that has the ability to penetrate the hair and provide targeted nutrition with weighing the hair down</p>\n<p>A superfood rich in Amino Acids, <strong>Green Pea Protein</strong> delivers intense hydration to help nourish and replenish the hair.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Shea Butter </em></strong>delivers moisture to dry or damaged hair from root to tip, and helps repair and protect against environmental stressors, dryness and brittleness. Quickly absorbing, this naturally-good-for-you butter, helps rehydrate the hair and scalp without clogging the cuticles.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","oversized-t-shirt-unisex-with-print":"<p><strong>NOBODY LOVES NO ONE</strong></p>\n<p><span>The oversized T-shirt is a true street fashion icon, suitable for both men and women. </span></p>\n<p><span>Made from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. </span></p>\n<p><span>Material: 100% cotton </span></p>\n<p><span>Fabric weight: 240 g/m²</span></p>\n<!---->","gatsby-moving-rubber-hair-wax-80g":"<h2>Gatsby Moving Rubber Hair Wax 80g</h2>\n<h3>Create Your Cool Wet Look</h3>\n<p>Craft your style with the Gatsby Moving Rubber Hair Wax. Designed with a non-sticky formula, this wax uniquely creates a wet look with a shiny finish. Ideal for short to long hair, it provides a moveable texture while maintaining your desired hold. Enjoy the refreshing scent of mild green apple fragrance. Made in Japan, this wax comes in a paraben-free formula for your peace of mind.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Wet Look:</strong> Unique non-sticky formula creates a wet look with a shiny finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Moveable Texture:</strong> Provides flexibility for your desired hairstyle while maintaining hold.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal for All Hair Lengths:</strong> Suitable for short to long hair.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Refreshing Fragrance:</strong> Enjoy the mild green apple scent.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Paraben-Free:</strong> Formulated without parabens for a gentle hold.</li>\n</ul>\n<!---->","real-nature-green-tea-mask-sheet":"<p><span>Nature Republic Real Nature Green Tea Mask Sheet is a skin-moisturizing cloth mask, the main ingredient of which is green tea seed extract, which contains plenty of antioxidants that protect the skin from adverse effects of the environment. The mask calms and balances the skin.</span></p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div tabindex=\"0\">\n<p><span lang=\"en\">Apply the mask to the cleansed facial skin after the toner and serum and leave it on for about 10-20 minutes. Gently pat the serum left on the skin to absorb into the face. If you want, continue the treatment with a face cream.</span></p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>Water, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Alcohol, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Trehalose, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract, Peg-80 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Camellia Sinensis Seed Extract, Glyceryl Caprylate, Arginine, Carbomer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Pvm/Ma Copolymer, Disodium Edta, Fragrance, Hexyl Cinnamal</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","laneige-cica-sleeping-mask":"<p><span>LANEIGE Cica Sleeping Mask 10ml</span></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span>Specially formulated for sensitive skin, the overnight Cica Sleeping Mask derived from Forest Yeast delivers intense moisture to soothe stressed skin and visibly strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier.</span></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<p>Cica Sleeping Mask is formulated with Laneige’s proprietary Forest Yeast extract that is  more effective than madecassoside from tiger grass. Strongly recommended for sensitive and dry skin that needs soothing moisture while sleeping.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PM</li>\n<li>Hydration</li>\n<li>Hypoallergenic</li>\n<li>Derm Tested<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><span><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></span></p>\n<p><span> moisturizer, apply evenly to face as the last step in your nighttime routine. Leave on overnight and rinse off in the morning. Use one to two times per week.</span></p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p><span>Fermented Forest Yeast Extract - proprietary ingredient that is 11.9% more effective compared to madecassoside.</span></p>\n<!---->","cosrx-advanced-snail-hydrogel-eye-patch-60pcs":"<p><span>Hydrogel eye patch which visibly hydrates, plumps and brightens the delicate eye area.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>BENEFITS</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>• Deeply hydrates, plumps, depuffs, and revitalizes eye areas with the power of Snail Secretion Filtrate and Niacinamide.</span></p>\n<p><span>• Delivers generous moisture and nourishment, rejuvenating tired and dull under-eye skin.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>HOW TO USE</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>Use the included tweezers to place the eye patches in the required area. Leave them on for 20~30 minutes before removing.</span></p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>Water, Glycerin, Snail Secretion Filtrate, Niacinamide, Carrageenan, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ceratonia Siliqua (Carob) Gum, Betaine, Hydroxyacetophenone, Allantoin, Chlorphenesin, Cyamopsis Tetragonoloba (Guar) Gum, Calcium Chloride, Butylene Glycol, Sucrose, Cellulose Gum, Adenosine, Potassium Chloride, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Ethylhexylglycerin, PEG-90M</p>\n\n<!---->","cosrx-aloe-sun-cream":"<p>When spending time in the sun, it’s important to protect your skin against harmful UV radiation. <strong>The Cosrx Aloe Soothing Sun Cream</strong> will do just that. Formulated with aloe arborescens leaf extract, it deeply moisturises and soothes the skin. Its light texture is easy to apply and it is absorbed quickly. Enjoy your time in the sun with peace of mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Characteristics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>protects the skin against harmful UVA and UVB radiation</li>\n<li>nourishes, moisturises and soothes the skin intensively</li>\n<li>does not leave a white residue</li>\n<li>has a light texture and is absorbed quickly</li>\n<li>also suitable for sensitive skin</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>SPF 50+ – protects the skin against harmful UVA and UVB radiation</li>\n<li>aloe arborescens leaf extract ‒ soothes and moisturises the skin</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to apply:</strong></p>\n<p>Apply the Cosrx Aloe sunscreen evenly onto clean skin 30 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged periods of sun exposure, after swimming, towel drying or excessive perspiration.</p>\n<!---->","kevin-murphy-smooth-again-wash":"<p><span>SMOOTHING SHAMPOO FOR THICK, COARSE HAIR</span></p>\n<p><span>Tame unruly tresses, and fight back against frizz with our targeted smoothing shampoo, SMOOTH.AGAIN.WASH. This smooth operator will nourish and refine thick, coarse and unruly hair, delivering all-over softness and a stronger, smoother, shinier-looking finish.</span></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<p>Fight frizz and tame unruly tresses with our smoothing shampoo for thick, coarse hair. This smooth operator is equipped with nourishing oils and butters, like Monoi and Murumuru, that help hair retain essential moisture for all-over softness. Even the wildest of frizz becomes smooth and refined with incredible shine.</p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE</strong></p>\n<p>Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse with SMOOTH.AGAIN RINSE. Can be used daily, and as part of our SMOOTH regimen</p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<p>A sacred fragrance oil from the Tahitian Gardenia flower, <strong><em>Monoi Oil</em></strong> imparts shine and softness as it helps to rebuild and restore the hair.</p>\n<p>Known for being rich in vitamins and antioxidants that are beneficial to overall hair health, <strong><em>Sunflower Seed Extract</em></strong> helps to prevent colour being stripped from the hair, while delivering nourishing moisturisation.</p>\n<p>Rich in essential fatty acids, <strong><em>Murumuru Seed Butter </em></strong>is from the <strong><em>Astrocaryum Murumuru</em></strong> tree found in Brazil, and throughout the Amazon Rainforest. Known to help restore elasticity and used in anti-ageing skincare, it helps the hair retain essential moisture.</p>\n<p>Used for centuries in cosmetics throughout the Mediterranean, <strong><em>Olive Fruit Oil </em></strong>helps to mimic the hair’s own healthy oils, and protects from heat and styling damage.</p>\n<!---->","kevin-murphy-fresh-hair-1":"<p><strong>KEVIN.MURPHY FRESH.HAIR</strong></p>\n<p><span>Go ahead, fake a blow-out with FRESH.HAIR, we won’t tell. Our refreshing dry shampoo spray soaks up excess dirt, oil and product from the hair. Citrus Oil instantly freshens and deodorises with its delightful scent while delivering Antioxidant benefits and shine. Whether you want to erase your sins from the night before or boost limp hair having a midday meltdown, FRESH.HAIR is your go-to product that transforms hair back to fresh, bouncy locks.</span></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instantly refreshes and removes odours</li>\n<li>Freshens up lifeless hair</li>\n<li>Removes excess product from the hair</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HOW TO APPLY</strong></p>\n<p>SHAKE. SHAKE. SPRAY. Shake well, and spray lightly over dry hair, rub into the hair or brush through.</p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"collapsible-title-3524730224991f815dbbb04a12-3\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Full of antioxidant goodness and bursting with vitamins, <em>Citrus Recticulata (Tangerine) Peel Oil </em>not only helps protect against stressors, its delightful scent helps stimulate the senses too. This hardworking essential oil also helps to create intense shine.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","young-again-dry-conditioner":"<p><strong>KEVIN.MURPHY <span>YOUNG.AGAIN DRY CONDITIONER</span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div><span>Revive dull hair with moisture between washes. This rejuvenating and conditioning dry powder spray adds weightless moisture and increases manageability, making it perfect for all hair types—especially dry, damaged hair. Our signature Immortelle Oil moisturises and softens hair while providing powerful Antioxidant and anti-ageing benefits. This nutrient-rich spray goes on easy and dries quickly for a soft, velvety finish.</span></div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div><strong>HOW TO APPLY</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div><span>Shake well and spray onto dry hair from mid-lengths to ends. Comb through and finish as desired.</span></div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong></div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"collapsible-title-87e9ce191c9caa64d80b085ac9-3\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Sunflower Seed Extract provides antioxidant properties to help prevent drying from sun exposure.</p>\n<p>Panthenol (B5) enhances manageability and softness while repelling humidity.</p>\n<p>Immortelle helps to moisturise and soften the hair.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-renewing-shampoo":"<p>Daily anti-aging treatment shampoo</p>\n<p> <span>Gentle shampoo that helps maintain the wellbeing of scalp and hair. The Renewing system gives softer, shinier and full-bodied hair.</span></p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"benefits\"><span>Benefits</span></label></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Anti-aging antioxidants stimulate cell turnover while maintaining the longevity of hair and scalp. <span>Without parabens and sulphates</span>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Gently massage into damp hair, leave on for 2-3 minutes then rinse.<br>Repeat application if necessary. When needed, any time you want.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n<div><span>Spinach extract in Renewing is rich in antioxidants, and maqui berry helps to protect the health of your hair and scalp.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-wellbeing-shampoo":"<p>Daily Shampoo for Healthy Hair</p>\n<p><span>Light shampoo enriched with extracts and proteins with moisturizing, protective and anti-oxidant properties.</span><br><span>Its full-bodied and rich foam cleanses without attacking and changing the hair structure.</span></p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"benefits\"><span>Benefits</span></label></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Hair is soft, well-nourished and easy to style. The flowering Echinacea plant is full of antimicrobial properties for gentle cleansing and antioxidants to keep hair strong and healthy.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Apply a small amount of product to damp hair, massage in and then rinse out.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span>The echinacea extract in Well-Being acts as a strong antioxidant, rich in polyphenols and sugar.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-detoxifying-scrub-shampoo":"<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Revitalizing Scalp Shampoo</p>\n<p><span>Detoxifying shampoo with gentle surfactants and scrub particles. It gently, but deeply cleanses the scalp protecting it from free radicals.</span></p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"benefits\"><span>Benefits</span></label></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Provides a gentle yet deep cleanse, as well as protection against free radicals.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<strong></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Wet the hair and scalp, and massage in. Rinse thoroughly.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div><span>All the formulations of the Detoxifying family are enriched with Phytoceuticals extracted from artichoke, rich in polyphenols and with a very high antioxidant power</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-calming-shampoo":"<p>Calming shampoo for sensitive scalps <span>It cleanses gently, it soothes and calms sensitive and sensitised scalp.</span></p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"benefits\"><span>Benefits</span></label></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>Without parabens and sulphates. </span>Scalp is left clean and soothed.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use</span></label></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Gently massage into damp hair, allow to process for a few minutes, then rinse.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients</span></label></strong></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>The phytoceuticals in Calming are extracted from blueberries, which are rich in polyphenols and sugar with a high anti-inflammatory power.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-nourishing-shampoo":"<p><span>Davines Nourishing Shampoo cleanses gently with a nourishing action without changing the hair structure.</span></p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"benefits\"><span>Benefits</span></label></strong></p>\n<p>Nourishing revitalising formula.<br>Recommendend for dehydrated scalp and for dry, brittle and damaged hair.<br>Natural active ingredients.</p>\n<p><strong><label for=\"how-to\"><span>How to use</span></label></strong></p>\n<p>Apply to scalp and damp hair, massaging in gently. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary.<br>The treatment with Nourishing Shampoo can be performed any time you wish according to scalp and hair needs.</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><label for=\"ingredients\"><span>Ingredients</span></label></strong></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div><span>The Nourishing family contains phytoceuticals extracted from grapes, rich are rich in polyphenols and antioxidants.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---->","davines-purifying-shampoo":"<h2>Dandruff Shampoo</h2>\n<p><span>Shampoo for scalps with dry or greasy dandruff. Clarifying and detoxifying, Purifying Shampoo fights microbial attacks and dandruff, establishing a healthy environment for hair growth.</span></p>\n<p><span>Hair and scalp are healthy and flake-free. Rich in anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial polyphenols and sugars, dandelion helps to cleanse and balance without causing irritation.</span></p>\n<p><span>The Purifying family is enriched with dandelion phytoceuticals, which have a strong anti-inflammatory and antioxidant power.</span></p>","davines-energizing-shampoo":"<h2>Balancing Shampoo</h2>\n<p><span>Energizing shampoo that gently cleanses the hair, giving a feeling of energy, vigor, and well-being to the scalp. This stimulating and revitalizing shampoo is particularly suitable for fragile hair prone to falling out</span></p>\n<p><span>Helps stimulate new hair growth while reinforcing weak hair to prevent future breakage.</span></p>\n<p><span>All products in the Energizing family are enriched with a Hair Energy Complex, designed to fight and protect against hair loss.</span></p>","davines-replumping-shampoo":"<h2>Shampoo for Fine Hair</h2>\n<p><span>This replumping shampoo creates a full-bodied foam that cleanses gently without changing hair structure.The formula gives elasticity, hydration and protection.</span></p>\n<p><span>Hair appears thicker, fuller and is protected from breakage.</span></p>\n<p><span>The plum phytoceuticals in Replumping are rich in polyphenols and flavonoids, antioxidants that fight free radicals while toning and elasticizing your hair.</span></p>","davines-rebalancing-shampoo":"<h2>Oil rebalancing shampoo </h2>\n<p><span>Balancing shampoo formula to combat excess sebum production. It fights against sebum hyper-production and keeps the scalp clean.</span></p>\n<p><span>Deeply cleanses hair removing excess oil without stripping natural moisture.</span></p>\n<p><span>Rebalancing Shampoo contains phytoceuticals extracted from lemon, which are rich in carbohydrates and sugars to fight inflammation.</span></p>","kevin-murphy-angel-masque":"<div>\n<div>STRENGTHENING &amp; THICKENING MASQUE FOR FINE, COLOURED HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>A restorative at-home treatment MASQUE providing deep conditioning, strength and essential repair to fine and damaged hair. ANGEL.MASQUE leaves hair visibly healthier, shinier and thicker, and contains essential ingredients to help protect against future damage. Our richly strengthening MASQUE is ideal for fine, fragile, broken and colour-damaged hair. It also helps prevent breakage, and aids in the repair of split, damaged ends.</div>\n</div>","davines-the-quick-fix-circle":"<span>The red clay in the mask is enriched with iron and hair-friendly minerals, which instantly makes hair stronger. Hyaluronic acid instantly binds to the hair structure and provides instant hydration.</span>","davines-the-spotlight-circle":"<span>The moringa oil in the mask is a blend of fatty acids, vitamins, minerals and is extremely protein-rich - all to ensure you get outstandingly shiny hair.</span>","davines-the-restless-circle":"<span>An invisible hair mask that doesn't weigh hair down, but gives extra protection to fragile and frequently treated hair. Contains Chia Seed Extract, which binds water into the hair, is antioxidant-rich and strengthens hair.</span>","davines-the-renaissance-circle":"<span>A texture-enhancing mask for hair length and ends. Heals damaged hair, restoring strength, shine and softness. Contains yellow clay and babassu oil. Yellow clay heals and restores the hair cuticle, while babassu oil deeply nourishes and softens.</span>","kevin-murphy-session-spray":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>STRONG HOLD FINISHING SPRAY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>The session stylist’s ultimate weapon when it comes to holding everything in its rightful place. Spray SESSION.SPRAY over any finished look for firm, weightless, long-lasting hold. Provides intense hold and memory plus excellent humidity resistance, and brushes out easily and effectively without a trace of flakiness.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weightless, firm hold</li>\n<li>Humidity resistant</li>\n<li>Designed with great holding memory</li>\n<li>Enriched with natural fragrance oils</li>\n<li>Helps you create endless styles that last</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>SPRAY. SPRAY. SPRAY.</strong><span> Spray a fine mist 6 inches / 16 cm from the hair, allow seconds to dry, and shape/style as desired. Spray a final time to set in place.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-session-spray-flex":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>A LIGHT, FLEXIBLE FINISHING HAIRSPRAY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>For those who crave a lighter hold with more flexibility, SESSION.SPRAY FLEX is your go-to finishing hairspray. Our lightweight, fast-drying formula features flexible moulding resins to give your style a workable, lived-in hold with the same humidity resistance and flake-free properties of our beloved SESSION.SPRAY. Our special Elasticity Blend made up of natural extracts helps give hair moisture, strength and smoothness. For every can of SESSION.SPRAY FLEX sold, a financial contribution will be made to help reduce global carbon emissions.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flake Free</li>\n<li>Humidity resistance</li>\n<li>Flexible</li>\n<li>Lightweight</li>\n<li>Fast-Drying</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>SPRAY. STYLE. FLEX.</strong><span> Shake well and spray evenly on dry hair to create a flexible finish.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-blow-dry-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>NOURISHING AND REPAIRING CONDITIONER</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Our Anti-Breakage Technology works together to nourish and protect hair with added protective benefits against heat damage*. A repairing and nourishing conditioner that forms a protective layer that guards against colour loss and environmental stressors. *When used as a part of the BLOW.DRY REGIMEN. ** At KEVIN.MURPHY we are committed to the environment. Please learn more about our evolving packaging initiative.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<p><span>• Hydrating</span></p>\n<p><span>• Nourishing</span></p>\n<p><span>• Strengthening</span></p>\n<p><span>• Heat protection</span></p>\n<p><span>• Colour safe</span></p>\n<p><span>• Smooths</span></p>\n<p><span>• Safe for everyday use</span></p>\n<p>Directions: Apply to freshly washed hair, leave for 1-2 minutes and rinse. For best results style with a BLOW.DRY by KEVIN.MURPHY styling product of choice.<br></p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-crystal-angel":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>COLOUR ENHANCING SHINE TREATMENTS.</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>A family of four colour enhancing treatments. Designed to improve the condition of all hair types, impart a lustrous shine and offer a range of tonal solutions. The pigments have been selected to enhance existing tones, neutralise unwanted tones and improve colour longevity without build up on the hair. SUGARED.ANGEL Creamy beige colour enhancing shine treatment COOL.ANGEL Cool ash colour enhancing shine treatment CRYSTAL.ANGEL Illuminating gloss colour enhancing shine treatment AUTUMN.ANGEL Apricot rosé colour enhancing shine treatment</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sulphate Free</li>\n<li>Paraben Free</li>\n<li>Colour pigments</li>\n<li>Tone and enhance</li>\n<li>Neutralise unwanted tones</li>\n<li>Create shine</li>\n<li>Nourish with moisture</li>\n<li>Protect</li>\n<li>Illuminating Shine</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.</strong></p>\n<p>Wet Hair. Shampoo first. Apply the desired COLOURING.ANGEL. Wait 3-5 mins and rinse.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-body-mass":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>LEAVE-IN PLUMPING CONDITIONING TREATMENT</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Level up your hair game while making a difference with KEVIN.MURPHY’s limited-edition BODY.MASS! Partnering with HairToStay, each spritz supports those with chemo-related hair loss. Transform thin strands into lush tresses while making an impact. As the name implies…this is BODY in a bottle. Created using eyelash thickening and lengthening technology,<br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instantly restores the appearance of distressed, fine and damaged hair</li>\n<li>Imparts rich moisture and shine</li>\n<li>Contains nourishing ingredients to help restore, repair and strengthen</li>\n<li>Adds volume and fullness to the hair</li>\n<li>Colour-safe and gentle enough for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HOW TO APPLY</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Spray</span><strong> BODY.MASS </strong><span>evenly throughout damp or towel dried hair, concentrating on the roots and scalp. Do not rinse, dry and style as usual.</span></p>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-everlasting-colour-leave-in":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>BOND-BUILDING, COLOUR PROTECTIVE LEAVE-IN TREATMENT</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Bond-building colour protective treatment. Lightweight leave-in spray treats hair from the inside, strengthening hairs resistance for improved, more robust and healthier hair. Preserves colour vibrancy and protects hair from environmental stressors while nourishing, hydrating and repairing.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acidic pH Leave-In</li>\n<li>Colour-locking</li>\n<li>Bond-building</li>\n<li>Creates shine</li>\n<li>Environmental Protection</li>\n<li>Repairs &amp; Strengthens</li>\n<li>Detangling</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span><strong>SPRAY.COMB.LEAVE. </strong>Spray onto wet hair, comb through and leave-in. For best results, use with the entire EVERLASTING.COLOUR regimen</span></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-everlasting-colour-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>COLOUR PROTECT CONDITIONER WITH PH SEALING TECHNOLOGY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Colour protect conditioner with pH sealing technology. A colour-locking conditioner forms a protective layer to guard against colour loss and environmental stressors, while pH balancers help create shine and improve hair’s condition, softness, and hydration while reducing damage and never weighing down the hair.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acidic pH conditioner</li>\n<li>Colour-locking</li>\n<li>Creates shine</li>\n<li>Restores condition</li>\n<li>Nourishes &amp; Hydrates</li>\n<li>Weightless</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span><strong>APPLY.ABSORB.RINSE.</strong> Apply to freshly washed hair, leave for 1-2 minutes and rinse. For best results, use with the entire EVERLASTING.COLOUR regimen.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-everlasting-colour-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>COLOUR PROTECT SHAMPOO WITH PH SEALING TECHNOLOGY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Colour protect shampoo with pH sealing technology A sulphate-free pH balanced shampoo gently cleanses and closes the cuticle for a shine that helps to lock colour in while protecting hair strands from hard water mineral accumulation to guarantee brilliance.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acidic pH shampoo</li>\n<li>Colour-locking</li>\n<li>Creates shine</li>\n<li>Protects against hard water minerals</li>\n<li>Nourishes and Hydrates</li>\n<li>Weightless</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HOW TO APPLY</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>WASH.RINSE.REPEAT. Apply to wet hair and massage into hair and scalp. Rinse and repeat. For best results, use with the entire EVERLASTING.COLOUR regimen.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-hydrate-me-masque":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><span>Kevin Murphy Hydrate - Me Masque</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"false\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>The Kevin Murphy Hydrate - Me Masque hair mask is an essential step in your hair care ritual. Give it a moment to regenerate and it will repay you with vitality and beauty.</p>\n<p><strong>Characteristics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>moisturises intensely</li>\n<li>goes deep into the hair fibre</li>\n<li>gives hair a brilliant shine</li>\n<li>hair is soft to the touch</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to use:</strong><br>Wash with shampoo, then apply to damp hair. Leave to act as instructed on the packaging, then rinse thoroughly.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-smooth-again":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>SMOOTHING, ANTI-FRIZZ LEAVE-IN TREATMENT</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Dual purpose SMOOTH.AGAIN delivers all the benefits of a hard-working styling product, alongside the smoothing and nourishing benefits of a treatment. Our leave-in smoothing treatment helps eliminate frizz, leaving you with smoother, silkier more touchable hair.</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-smooth-again-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><span>Kevin Murphy Smooth Again Rinse</span></strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong></div>\n<div>Characteristics</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"false\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>The Kevin Murphy Smooth Again conditioner makes your hair easy to detangle and nourishes it, something all healthy, beautiful hair needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Characteristics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>smooths and acts against frizz</li>\n<li>makes untangling and styling easier</li>\n<li>protects hair against damage</li>\n<li>improves the structure of the hair</li>\n<li>ensures brilliant shine</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to use:</strong><br>Apply after first washing with shampoo. Leave to act for a while, then rinse thoroughly.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-staying-alive-spray":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>LEAVE-IN TREATMENT FOR DRY, DAMAGED, OR COLOUR TREATED HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>So much more than a 70’s pop song…<strong>STAYING.ALIVE</strong> is our high-performance leave-in treatment, that instantly helps repair damaged or colour-treated hair. Enriched with silk proteins to help smooth and repair damage, and packed with antioxidants, this weightless mist of goodness promotes elasticity in the hair and helps overcome dryness, while teasing its way through tangles with ease.</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-young-again-oil":"<div>\n<div><strong>ANTI-AGEING LEAVE-IN TREATMENT OIL</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>The ultimate daily indulgence for damaged and ageing hair - YOUNG.AGAIN is a weightless leave-in treatment oil from our REJUVENATE regimen. Infused with Immortelle to help counteract oxidation and therefore the ageing process, our intensely nurturing treatment oil delivers deep conditioning benefits that leave hair feeling soft and smooth with an overall boost to shine. Use daily to fight the fight against dry, damaged, brittle hair and to provide protection against environmental stressors, and heat damage.</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-young-again-masque":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong><span face=\"Arial\">KEVIN.MURPHY YOUNG.AGAIN.MASQUE</span></strong></p>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\"><span>A nurturing and restorative at-home treatment MASQUE from our ANTI-AGEING regimen. YOUNG.AGAIN.MASQUE delivers deep conditioning to the hair and scalp, leaving hair full of youthful body and bounce.</span><br></span></p>\n<div>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\"><span>Benefits</span><br></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Antioxidant-rich blend helps to restore and replenish the hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Deep conditioning treatment imparts moisture, and helps soften the hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Known rejuvenating ingredients help restore a more youthful look</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Provides shine and lustre to the hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Ideal for dry, damaged and brittle hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\"><span>How to use</span></span></p>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\">Apply to freshly washed hair and massage into hair and scalp for 5 to 10 minutes to fully absorb the benefits, follow with a refreshing rinse.</span></p>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-young-again-rinse":"<p><strong>KEVIN.MURPHY YOUNG.AGAIN.RINSE</strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span face=\"Arial\"><span>luxurious conditioner helps restore youthful luster to dry, brittle, or damaged hair and delivers a unique complex of Amino Acids, essential oils, and known anti-aging ingredients to smooth frizz and impart shine, leaving the hair looking and feeling young again.</span><br></span></p>\n<div>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\"><span>Benefits</span><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Antioxidant-rich blend helps restore and replenish</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Delivers moisture and helps soften the hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Known rejuvenating ingredients help restore a more youthful look</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Provides shine and lustre to the hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Ideal for dry, damaged and brittle hair</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span face=\"Arial\">Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\"><span>How to use</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span face=\"Arial\">Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. </span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-murphy-young-again-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><span>Kevin Murphy Young Again Wash</span></strong></div>\n<div>Characteristics</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"false\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>The Kevin Murphy Young Again Wash shampoo cleans the scalp effectively, washes hair thoroughly, and restores its natural beauty.</p>\n<p><strong>Characteristics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>moisturises intensely</li>\n<li>regenerates and nourishes hair</li>\n<li>strengthens the hair fibre</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to use:</strong><br>Apply an appropriate amount of shampoo to wet hair. Work up a lather and rinse thoroughly. Repeat if necessary.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-muprhy-shimmer-shine":"<strong><strong>SHIMMER.SHINE BY KEVIN.MURPHY <br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<div>\n<div>REPAIRING SHINE MIST</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Add a little shimmer to your shine with a treatment spray that smells just as good as it looks. Lightweight finishing mist, with light reflective technology from high-end skincare, adds brilliant shine to the hair with no oily residue or added weight. SHIMMER.SHINE has a specially selected blend of ingredients from the Australian Rainforest, chosen for their ability to flourish in harsh climates, add elasticity and revive lackluster hair. Packed with Vitamins C and E, Baobab, Immortelle and Bamboo, it’s a spritz of shimmering goodness for the hair.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Infused with a nourishing blend of Australian Fruit Extracts</li>\n<li>Adds instant, radiant shine and a sublime scent</li>\n<li>Helps counteract dull, flat colour – even on dark tones</li>\n<li>Nourishing and moisturising</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">TWIRL. SPRAY. SHINE<span>.<br>Spray onto damp, towel-dried hair or directly onto dry hair. Do not rinse; leave to dry naturally or style as desired.</span><br><br>\n</div>\n</div>","kevin-muprhy-plumping-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>PLUMPING.RINSE BY KEVIN.MURPHY<br></strong>DENSIFYING CONDITIONER FOR THINNING HAIR<br>Treat fine, thin or ageing hair to a lavish level of conditioning goodness with PLUMPING.RINSE. Our luxurious RINSE delivers essential nourishment to help restore thickness, and boost volume, while imparting sublime shine and silky-soft texture.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Packed with essential ingredients to help hydrate the hair</li>\n<li>Helps protect and strengthen hair from root to tip</li>\n<li>Hair feels thicker, with added volume and bounce</li>\n<li>Delivers intense shine and silky-softness</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types, especially fine and ageing hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.<br>Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. Can be used daily, and as part of our THICKENING regimen. For optimal plumping results, use after washing with PLUMPING.WASH and finish with BODY.MASS.<br>\n<p><strong><br></strong></p>","kevin-muprhy-plumping-wash":"<p><strong>PLUMPING.WASH BY KEVIN.MURPHY<br></strong>DENSIFYING SHAMPOO FOR THINNING HAIR<br>Plump up in all the right places, and take your hair to a whole new level of volume and thickness with PLUMPING.WASH. Created to nourish every strand from root to tip, fine and ageing hair will transform into stronger, fuller-looking locks with renewed strength and vitality.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Thickens without weighing down the hair</li>\n<li>Stimulates circulation in the scalp while nourishing the hair follicles</li>\n<li>Helps to maintain the integrity of your hair’s health</li>\n<li>Creates volume, while delivering softness and shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types, especially fine and ageing hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT – Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse. Follow with PLUMPING.RINSE. Can be used daily, and as part of our THICKENING regimen.</p>","dead-head-butterfly":"<p><strong>Dead Head Butterfly </strong>﻿</p>\n<p>This unique limited edition decor - Dead Head butterflies inspired by the movie 'The Silence of the Lambs' - is a product of meticulous craftsmanship, with the utmost attention to detail. Each butterfly is handcrafted with love and precision to bring the atmosphere of dark classics and the world of cinema into your space. Our artist have brought each butterfly to life to make this decor truly special. Immerse yourself in the unique world of art and style with our Dead Head butterflies!\"</p>\n<p>Frame 17x17x3 cm.</p>","kevin-murphy-shimmer-me-blonde":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>SHIMMER.ME BLONDE BY KEVIN.MUPRHY</strong><br>REPAIRING SHINE TREATMENT FOR BLONDES<br>Don’t let blonde hair become dull and lackluster – treat it to a refreshing burst of SHIMMER.ME BLONDE. Our repairing shine treatment, with colour enhancers and optical brighteners, adds brilliant shimmer and radiant shine to highlighted, blonde or grey shades. Specially selected ingredients from the Australian Rainforest, chosen for their ability to flourish in harsh climates, add elasticity and moisture, while light reflective technology from high-end skincare weightlessly delivers magnificent shine.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infused with a nourishing blend of Australian Fruit Extracts</li>\n<li>Adds instant, radiant shine and a sublime scent</li>\n<li>Helps counteract yellow and golden tones</li>\n<li>Nourishing and moisturising</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">TWIRL. SPRAY. SHINE. Spray onto damp, towel-dried hair or directly onto dry hair. Do not rinse; leave to dry naturally or style as desired.<br>","kevin-muprhy-hydrate-me-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>HYDRATE-ME.WASH BY KEVIN.MURPHY</strong><br>HYDRATING SHAMPOO FOR NATURAL AND COLOURED HAIR<br>Quench dull, parched and dry hair, with a nourishing hydration pick-me-up. HYDRATE-ME.WASH is our super-smoothing, hydrating WASH that will replenish hair with much needed moisture. Ideal for hair that’s naturally dry, or exposed to harsh, dry climates, it’s packed with antioxidant goodness to help restore a healthy glow to parched locks.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Antioxidant-rich blend helps boost hydration</li>\n<li>Helps add essential moisture and shine</li>\n<li>Helps smooth the hair and delivers a silky-soft feel</li>\n<li>Packed with vitamins and nourishing oils</li>\n<li>Ideal for normal to dry hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT – Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse. Follow with HYDRATE-ME.RINSE. Can be used daily, and as part of our HYDRATE regimen<br>","kevin-murphy-hydrate-me-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>HYDRATE-ME.RINSE BY KEVIN.MURPHY</strong><br>MOISTURISING AND SMOOTHING CONDITIONER FOR NATURAL AND COLOURED HAIR<br>A luxurious hydrating and smoothing conditioner, designed to restore and replenish hair in need of repair. Ideal for naturally dry hair or for hair that’s been exposed to harsh, dry climates. HYDRATE-ME.RINSE provides an essential moisture boost to nourish dry, parched locks, and transforms the look and feel of split ends. Full of antioxidant goodness, HYDRATE-ME.RINSE leaves the hair with a nourished, healthy-looking glow.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Antioxidant rich blend helps boost hydration</li>\n<li>Helps add essential moisture and shine</li>\n<li>Helps smooth the hair and delivers a silky-soft feel</li>\n<li>Packed with vitamins and nourishing oils</li>\n<li>Ideal for normal to dry hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE. Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. For optimal results, use after washing with HYDRATE-ME.WASH, and as part of our HYDRATE regimen.<br>","kevin-murphy-angel-wash":"<strong>ANGEL.WASH BY KEVIN.MUPRHY</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>RESTORATIVE SHAMPOO FOR FINE COLOURED HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>If your over-stressed hair is in need of a little salvation, our delicate ANGEL.WASH volumising shampoo will nourish and transform fine, fragile hair that has been colour-treated or damaged. Infused with soothing essential oils, vitamins, proteins and antioxidants, ANGEL.WASH gently cleanses the scalp and hair while maximising colour longevity, and protecting against harmful free radicals.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Antioxidant-rich blend boosts volume to fine hair</li>\n<li>Helps strengthen and protect against stressors</li>\n<li>Helps to reduce hair breakage</li>\n<li>Helps prevent colour fade</li>\n<li>Colour safe and gentle enough for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT – Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse. Follow with ANGEL.RINSE. Can be used as desired, and as part of our VOLUME regimen.<br><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>","kevin-murphy-angel-rinse":"<strong>ANGEL.RINSE BY KEVIN.MURPHY</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>RESTORATIVE CONDITIONER FOR FINE COLOURED HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Treat fine, fragile and broken hair with ANGEL.RINSE, our weightless, volumising conditioning RINSE created to soothe and protect fine, damaged and colour treated hair. Delicately scented and deeply conditioning, Mango and Cocoa Butters help nourish and moisturise the hair without weighing it down.</div>\n<div>\n<strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Adds moisture without weighing down the hair</li>\n<li>Antioxidant-rich formula helps shield against free radicals</li>\n<li>Helps strengthen and protect against stressors</li>\n<li>Colour-safe and gentle enough for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.<br>Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. For optimal results, use after washing with ANGEL.WASH and as part of our VOLUME regimen.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>","kevin-murphy-blonde-angel":"<strong>BLONDE.ANGEL BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>COLOUR ENHANCING TREATMENT CONDITIONER FOR BLONDE HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Set just the right tone, and work to restore optimum condition and lustre to brassy, blah blah, blonde tones. BLONDE.ANGEL conditions and moisturises bleached, highlighted and grey hair, putting the bounce back into your blonde, while repairing any brassy or yellow tones.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Colour enhancing conditioner for blonde and grey hair</li>\n<li>Richly formulated to help counteract brassy tones</li>\n<li>Helps restore shine and brightness</li>\n<li>Helps maintain ‘cooler’ tones</li>\n<li>Helps present colour-stripping</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.<br> Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. For optimal repairing results, use after washing with BLONDE.ANGEL.WASH, and as part of our BLONDE regimen.<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>","kevin-muprhy-blonde-angel-wash":"<strong>BLONDE.ANGEL.WASH BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>COLOUR ENHANCING SHAMPOO FOR BLONDE HAIR</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Make every moment a bombshell moment, and banish brassy tones with BLONDE.ANGEL.WASH. Our Lavender-infused, colour-enhancing shampoo takes on all tones - from creamy to platinum, and with the help of added optical brighteners rescues dull colour - taking it from drab back to fab.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<ul>\n<li>Colour enhancing shampoo for blonde and grey hair</li>\n<li>Richly formulated to help counteract brassy tones</li>\n<li>Helps restore shine and brightness</li>\n<li>Helps maintain ‘cooler’ tones</li>\n<li>Helps prevent colour-stripping</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT – Apply to wet hair and massage gently through the hair and scalp. Rinse with BLONDE.ANGEL.RINSE. Can be used daily, and as part of our BLONDE regimen.<br>\n</div>\n</div>","captain-fawcett-nebula-john-petrucci-beard-balm":"<strong><strong>NEBULA JOHN PETRUCCI BEARD BALM BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<p>A rockstar Beard Balm to nourish and moisturise one’s magnificent mane.<br>Strutting top notes of exhilarating bergamot &amp; aromatic myrtle riff with the bittersweet tang of grapefruit, rising to an intense heart of earthy, violet orris, dark coffee &amp; woody cedar. A pulse of seductive musk trails a smoky backbeat laced with vetiver &amp; luxurious leather.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>smells pleasant</span></li>\n<li><span>helps tame unruly beards and shapes them</span></li>\n<li><span>provides long-lasting moisture to the beard and skin</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Ideally apply to your damp or dry, clean beard. Using the back of your thumbnail extract a small portion of balm &amp; warm by rubbing in the palms of your hands. Proceed to work the balm into the length of your beard, then comb or brush through for maximum hold, resulting in a tamed well nourished beard, that is easier to both shape &amp; style.</p>","captain-fawcett-ricki-hall-booze-baccy-beard-balm":"<strong>RICKI HALL BOOZE &amp; BACCY BEARD BALM BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p>This rather magnificent Beard Balm completes the trio with<i>Ricki Hall’s 'Booze &amp; Baccy'</i>Beard Oil &amp; Moustache Wax.<br>A unique fusion of 5 base creams and exotic waxes blended with 10 essential oils, this handmade pomade is simply a must-have addition to any gentleman’s grooming arsenal.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>smoothes moustaches and helps shape them</span></li>\n<li><span>easy to apply</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><span>Apply to your damp or dry, clean beard. Using the back of your thumbnail extract a small portion of balm &amp; warm by rubbing in the palms of your hands. Proceed to work the balm into the length of your beard, then comb or brush through for maximum hold, resulting in a tamed well nourished beard, that is easier to both shape &amp; style.</span></p>","captain-fawcett-nebula-moustache-wax":"<strong><strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <b>JOHN PETRUCCI'S NEBULA </b> MOUSTACHE WAX BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<p>This stellar Moustache Wax styles and tames the world’s wildest whiskers.<br>Top notes of exhilarating bergamot &amp; aromatic myrtle riff with the bittersweet tang of grapefruit, rising to an intense heart of earthy, violet orris, dark coffee &amp; tenacious woody cedar. A pulse of seductive musk trails a smoky backbeat laced with vetiver &amp; luxurious leather.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>smells pleasant</span></li>\n<li><span>helps tame unruly beards and shapes them</span></li>\n<li><span>provides long-lasting moisture to the beard and skin</span></li>\n<li><span>smooths mustaches and helps shape them</span></li>\n<li><span>adds shine</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Keep wax warm in either a waistcoat or trouser pocket. Use the back of your finger nail to remove a small amount of wax from the tin. Soften wax between thumb and forefinger, smooth into your moustache in an outwards &amp; upwards motion. To one’s now perky tips, add a further riff of wax in a final twisting flourish, thus ensuring a tip top finish.</p>","captain-fawcett-ricki-hall-booze-baccy-moustache-wax":"<strong>RICKI HALL BOOZE &amp; BACCY MOUSTACHE WAX BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br></strong>\n<p>A rich and complex blend of beeswax and essential oils combine to create luxurious base notes of honeyed fresh tobacco leaves, dusty aromatic frankincense, maple-like benzoin, woody oak moss and warm exotic vanilla bean, layered with mid notes of fresh hops and sweet bog myrtle finished with the top notes of spice from the bay rum tree and zesty orange.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>helps tame unruly beards</span></li>\n<li><span>supports healthy beard growth</span></li>\n<li><span>smoothes mustaches and helps shape them</span></li>\n<li><span>adds shine</span></li>\n<li><span>easy to apply</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Keep wax warm in either a waistcoat or trouser pocket. Use the back of your finger nail to remove a small amount of wax from the jar. Soften wax between thumb and forefinger, smooth into your moustache in an outwards &amp; upwards motion. Adding a little wax in a final twisting flourish to your by now perky tips will ensure a tip top finish.</p>","captain-fawcett-sea-salt-spray":"<strong>SEA SALT SPRAY BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br></strong>Captain Fawcett’s Sea Salt Spray lifts landlocked follicles like a flurry of wild wind. Plant extracts and sea minerals condition and nourish while rich emollients fix moisture, adding natural texture with a matte finish. Created with salt from one of the world’s oldest suppliers with an exhilarating coastal fragrance for gentlemen adventurers, men of the road, pirates, navigators, sailors, surfers, buccaneers, beachcombers, wily rovers and mermen from Margate to Madagascar.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br>\n<ul>\n<li><span>adds volume and elasticity to hair</span></li>\n<li><span>nourishes hair deeply</span></li>\n<li><span>provides essential moisture to the hair</span></li>\n</ul>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Use on damp hair, work in by hand or comb through and leave to dry naturally as one might at the beach. Thicker hair may well require a little more, finer hair a little less so experiment as you wish. Excellent for longer and mid-length hair and to add ruffled texture to short styles. For increased volume, spray may be applied directly to roots - start sparingly and add as required.<strong><br></strong>","captain-fawcett-maharajah-beard-oil":"<strong><strong>MAHARAJAH BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT</strong></strong>\n<p>In a neat travel size, this handsomely fragranced Beard Oil richly nourishes, lending a subtle gleam to one’s noble mane. Conjuring the heat of enchanted Indian nights. Redolent of aromatic smoke and the crush of bright petals, created by the Captain’s master blender who wove heady rose with peppery spice, rich musk, cedar &amp; leather studded with dazzling citrus top notes.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>moisturizes, doesn't dry out the skin</span></li>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>smooths the beard and reduces frizziness</span></li>\n<li><span>softens the beard</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Dispense a few drops into the palm of your hand &amp; rub together. Smooth the oil thoroughly into your beard &amp; gently comb through for a royal finish.<strong><br></strong></p>","captain-fawcett-nebula-john-petrucci-beard-oil":"<strong><strong>NEBULA JOHN PETRUCCI BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<p>The extraordinary Nebula Signature Series is nothing less than a tribute to the mysterious harmony of the universe.<em><br></em>This Beard Oil features top notes of exhilarating bergamot &amp; aromatic myrtle riff with a bittersweet tang of grapefruit, rising to an intense heart of earthy, violet orris, dark coffee &amp; tenacious woody cedar. A pulse of seductive musk trails a smoky backbeat laced with vetiver &amp; luxurious leather.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>moisturizes, doesn't dry out the skin</span></li>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>smooths the beard and reduces frizziness</span></li>\n<li><span>softens the beard</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Dispense a few drops into the palm of your hand &amp; rub together.Smooth the oil thoroughly into your beard &amp; gently comb through for a </span><i>Rock ‘n’ Roll</i><span> finish.</span><br></p>","captain-fawcett-ricki-hall-booze-baccy-beard-oil":"<strong><strong>RICKI HALL BOOZE &amp; BACCY BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<p>Captain Fawcett is delighted to have collaborated with the World renowned Dandy &amp; Gentleman about town Mr Ricki Hall in concocting this simply delectable bespoke Beard Oil.<br>A rich and complex blend of essential oils which combine the luxurious base notes of honeyed fresh tobacco leaves, dusty aromatic frankincense, maple-like benzoin, woody oak moss and warm exotic vanilla bean, layered with mid notes of fresh hops and sweet bog myrtle finished with the top notes of spice from the bay rum tree and zesty orange.<br><span><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>provides long-lasting moisture to the beard and skin</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>leaves no residue in the beard and doesn't stick beard </span>hairs together</li>\n<li>smells pleasant</li>\n<li>keeps the beard healthy and shiny</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></span><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Dispense a few drops of Fawcett’s finest Beard Oil onto the palm of your hand &amp; smooth into your Beard. Gently comb through for a tip top finish.</span><br></p>","captain-fawcett-triumphant-beard-oil":"<strong><strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <b>RUFUS HOUND TRIUMPHANT</b> BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT</strong></strong>\n<p>This splendidly nourishing pocket elixir is perfect for popping in one’s saddlebag, with a fragrance somewhat reminiscent of the balmy days of Spring; olfactory rural stimuli reaped whilst riding a beloved motorcycle thru England’s green &amp; pleasant countryside.<br>A heady perfume leading with Bergamot, Lime &amp; Ylang over a summery thrum of Blackcurrant, Clove &amp; Galbanum grounded by earthy Sandalwood, Ambergris and Musk.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>keeps the beard healthy and shiny</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Dispense a few drops into the palm of your hand &amp; smooth into your beard. Gently comb through for a </span><i>tip-top finish.</i><br></p>","captain-fawcett-whisky-beard-oil":"<p><strong>THE GENTLEMAN'S TIPPE WHISKY BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br></strong>I am delighted to serve wee dram of my luxuriant whisky inspired Gentleman’s Tipple Whisky Beard Oil, an opulent elixir, lavishly infused with the aroma notes of the Captain’s preferred snifter. A veritable sharpener for those who are hirsute of face.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>moisturizes, doesn't dry out the skin</span></li>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>smooths the beard and reduces frizziness</span></li>\n<li><span>softens the beard</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Dispense a few drops of Fawcett’s finest Beard Oil onto the palm of your hand &amp; smooth into your Beard. Gently comb through for a tip top finish.<strong><br></strong></p>","lumin-skin-keratin-fortifying-conditioner":"<p><strong><strong>KERATIN FORTIFYING CONDITIONER BY LUMIN SKIN<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>Our keratin-rich conditioner for men helps repair damaged hair, smooth dry ends, and nourish hair follicles for stronger, healthier hair.<br>Boost the health of your hair with this lightweight, jojoba-infused formula that balances scalp pH and improves the overall look and feel of your hair.<br></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:<meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Repairs damage and dry ends</li>\n<li>Offers nourishing hydration</li>\n<li>Helps repair damaged follicles<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Dispense onto clean, wet hair and massage well onto scalp and hair.Thoroughly rinse out until no foam remains. For external use only.<strong><br></strong></p>","queen-of-colours":"<p><strong>\"King of Colours\" UNISEX deep V-neck T-shirt with an extended back </strong><br></p>\n<p><span>Made of high-quality materials that ensure comfort and allow the skin to breathe.</span><br><br><span>The fabric contains elastane, which is stretchy and fits the figure. The material is wear-resistant and does not lose its shape after repeated washing. Does not fade over time.</span><br><br><strong>Print:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hypoallergenic paint</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for washing in the washing machine. It is recommended to use the delicate wash (hand wash) mode.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Composition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Cotton 98%</span></li>\n<li><span>Spandex 2%</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Care guide:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Hand wash/machine wash up to 30°C</span></li>\n<li><span>The maximum ironing temperature is 110°C</span></li>\n<li><span>Do not bleach</span></li>\n<li><span>Suitable for dry cleaning</span></li>\n<li><span>Drying on a horizontal surface in a straightened state</span></li>\n<li><span>Tumble drying is prohibited</span></li>\n</ul>","anti-gravity-spray":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>WEIGHTLESS HAIRSPRAY FOR VOLUME AND OIL-FREE SHINE <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>Defy gravity, and go bigger and even more beautiful with a burst of ANTI.GRAVITY.SPRAY. Our lightweight, non-aerosol hair spray imparts a lush, shine to the hair, and will hold your style in place for longer.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Non-aerosol hair spray</li>\n<li>Weightless formula that won’t weigh the hair down</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br>SPRAY. DEFINE. DRY<strong><span>.<br></span></strong>Apply ANTI.GRAVITY.SPRAY to dry hair after styling.<strong><span><br></span></strong>","anti-gravity":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>OIL FREE LOTION FOR VOLUMISING AND TEXTURISING <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>Create styles that are out-of-this-world with our weightless ANTI.GRAVITY lotion. This volumiser and texturiser allows you to create bigger, thicker-looking hair instantly, and will help hold your style in place whether it’s long, short, curled or blown-out. Also helps to control flyaway strands, and provides a lush, oil-free shine.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Increases volume, boosts body and adds shine</li>\n<li>Provides long-lasting, weightless hold</li>\n<li>Helps control flyaway strands</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:<br></strong>APPLY. DEFINE. DRY<strong><span>.</span></strong><br><span>Apply </span>ANTI.GRAVITY to damp hair before styling.","doo-over":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong> DRY POWDER FINISHING HAIRSPRAY <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY<br></strong>Want a ‘doo’ that packs volume and hold, but with a softer look and feel…DOO.OVER is everything you desire and yet so much more - it’s a ‘hair-doo’ in a can! DOO.OVER is a dry powder finishing spray in-one, that allows for natural movement, yet holds everything in just the right place. The end result is your dream ‘doo’ with a soft, velvety finish, that smells so good you’ll be turning heads for all the right reasons.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides a soft velvety feel with a light hold</li>\n<li>Removes excess oils and product residue</li>\n<li>Adds hold that lasts</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types and lengths</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br>\n<p>SHAKE. SPRAY. STYLE.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Shake </span>DOO.OVER<span> well, and spray evenly onto dry hair as a finishing spray immediately after styling. For optimal results use as part of our </span>THICKENING<span> regimen.</span><br></p>","blow-dry-ever-smooth":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<p><strong><span>HEAT ACTIVATED LONG LASTING HAIR FLUID <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>EVER.SMOOTH is a lightweight spray that creates an extremely silky, soft, voluminous and clump-free finish.</span></p>\n<p><span>The KEVIN.MURPHY SMOOTH range softens, smooths and helps fight flyaways to finish thick, rough and unmanageable hair with a nourishing blend of Cupuacu Seed, Cocoa and Grass Grass Butters, Restorative Monoi Oil, Nourishing Monkey Bread Seed Oil and Orchid Extract.</span></p>\n<p><span>Due to its innovative composition, EVER.SMOOTH is ideal for all hair types. EVER.SMOOTH spreads evenly with the help of heat. Polymers - derived from skin care technology - cross-link and form an invisible hydrophobic shield. It improves and protects the appearance of each strand, helping to lock in moisture while combating frizz from the environment. The result is healthy-looking hair and lightness.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>BENEFITS:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Anti-Frizz</span></li>\n<li><span>Humidity Resistant</span></li>\n<li><span>Creates Smoothness</span></li>\n<li><span>Style Extender</span></li>\n<li><span>Sulphate Free</span></li>\n<li><span>Paraben Free</span></li>\n<li><span>Cruelty Free</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><strong>USAGE:<br></strong></span><span>Apply after shampooing and conditioning to towel dried hair. Separate hair into </span><span>sections and spray liberally. Blow dry each section with the brush of your choice to activate </span><span>the smoothing technology and longevity of style. You can also use a hot </span><span>tool to further enhance the shape of your style.</span></p>","heated-defense":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>LEAVE-IN HEAT PROTECTION FOR ALL HAIR TYPES <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong><br></span><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Protect your hair against daily life’s biggest aggressor, heat damage.<br>HEATED.DEFENSE is a weightless and invisible leave-in treatment foam to protect your hair against damage associated with heated and mechanical tools. Providing heat protection up to 232˚C / 450˚F, this leave-in foam distributes easily and disappears in all hair types, providing a weightless protective shield.</span></p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n<li>Protects the hair against heat</li>\n<li>Reduces damage</li>\n<li>Helps smoothe and detangle hair</li>\n<li>Softening and lightweight</li>\n</ul>\n<div title=\"Page 82\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul></ul>\n<p><span><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Rub into damp hair, then style as desired.<br></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","bedroom-hair":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 17\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 19\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 22\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 23\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 24\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 25\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 27\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 28\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 30\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 31\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 32\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 33\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 35\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 38\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 17\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 19\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 22\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 23\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 24\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 25\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 27\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 28\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 30\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 31\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 32\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 33\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 35\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 38\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>FLEXIBLE TEXTURING HAIRSPRAY <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>BEDROOM.HAIR is a lightweight, flexible hairspray that adds shine and hold to achieve a  </span><em><span>\"lively look\"</span></em><span> . The hair is touchable while having wonderful texture mobility and separation. Contains a trio of natural ingredients to keep hair soft and manageable. With a flexible hold that lasts all day, BEDROOM.HAIR is the perfect product for all hair types, colors and textures.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 20\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 26\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 34\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 14\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 15\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 51\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 53\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 10\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 16\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 21\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 29\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 36\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Shape, hold, create and control with KEVIN.MURPHY STYLE/CONTROL range of high-performance products packed with naturally derived ivy, green tea and bamboo extracts.</span></p>\n<p><span>BEDROOM.HAIR injects tactile texture, separation and movement into your hair, while still allowing you (or someone special) to run your fingers through your hair from root to tip - perfect sexy bedroom hair with just the right amount of texture. Our flexible, texturizing finishing spray ensures perfectly imperfect curls every time.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div title=\"Page 11\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 12\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 13\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 14\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div title=\"Page 15\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span>BENEFITS:<br></span></strong></p>\n<div title=\"Page 69\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Lightweight finishing spray delivers flexible hold and touchable texture</li>\n<li>Contains a trio of hero ingredients for added texture and protection</li>\n<li>Helps enhance elasticity and suppleness for increased touchability</li>\n<li><span>Helps protect hair from environmental stressors</span></li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Helps condition and strengthen the hair</span>\n</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">SPRAY. SPRAY. SPRAY.<strong><br></strong>Apply to dry hair as a finishing spray for all-over body and bounce.Your new best friend from our STYLE/CONTROL regimen<br></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","system-4-moisture-scalp-lotion-m":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>MOISTURE SCALP LOTION M BY SYSTEM 4<br></strong>Intensely moisturizing treatment for the scalp<strong><br></strong>Moisture Scalp Lotion is a gentle, full-bodied intensive scalp care. Leave-in moisturizing intensive treatment soothes sensitive and irritated scalp. Supports the natural moisture balance and well-being of the scalp. Can be used on the entire scalp or only on areas of the scalp where additional hydration is needed. In addition to the scalp, it is also suitable for the skin of the face and neck, for example to relieve skin irritation after shaving. Can be used daily.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Effectively moisturizes the scalp and other skin</li>\n<li>Soothes the scalp</li>\n<li>Reduces itching</li>\n<li>In addition to the scalp, it is also suitable for the skin of the face and neck</li>\n<li>Parfume free and <span>dermatologically tested</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tube is made of 50% recycled material</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Use on the scalp:</strong> After washing, apply with a dosing needle to the scalp for distribution and rub the scalp with gentle rotating fingertips. Can also be applied only to areas that need extra moisturizing on the scalp.</p>\n<p><strong>Use on the skin:</strong> Apply a small amount of the product on the face and neck, eg after shaving.</p>\n<p>pH 5.5</p>","system-4-shale-oil-shampoo-4":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>SHALE OIL SHAMPOO 4 BY SYSTEM 4</strong><br>Therapeutic shampoo for very oily hair and sensitive scalp<strong><br></strong>Special, effective shampoo for very oily hair and sensitive scalp. Soothes irritated scalp and maintains its natural moisture balance without feeling oily. Shale oil balances excessive sebum secretion and soothes both itchy and irritated scalps. Menthol refreshes and promotes superficial blood circulation in the scalp.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces excess fat formation</li>\n<li>Soothes the scalp</li>\n<li>Reduces itching</li>\n<li>Parfume free and dermatologically tested</li>\n<li>The bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br>Apply shampoo thoroughly to hair &amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than regular shampoo.</p>\n<p>pH 5.7</p>","cbd-daily-conditioner":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<p><span>Our <strong>CBD Conditioner</strong> is a great companion to our </span>CBD Daily Shampoo<span>. It’s carefully crafted with a mix of nature-based ingredients and oils that retain moisture for ultimate frizz-free manageability and shine. </span></p>\n<p><span>While our CBD Daily Shampoo soothes and cleanses scalp and hair, our CBD Daily Conditioner focuses on </span>enriching your hair<span> with a nourishing mix of antioxidants and essential fatty acids that give you those good hair days that’ll come by a lot more often with these in hand.<br><br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps moisturize your dry scalp while detangling and soothing hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Sulfate-free</li>\n<li>Good for all hair types</li>\n<li>Safe for color-treated hair</li>\n<li>Contains 10mg of CBD!</li>\n</ul>","cbd-daily-shampoo":"<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<p>Great hair starts at the roots. Our <strong>CBD Daily Shampoo</strong> is specially-formulated with a unique blend of Hemp, Argan, and other essential oils that cleanse, hydrate and nourish dry scalp to give your hair the healthy foundation it needs. It’s also sulfate-free, and safe for color-treated hair.</p>\n<p>Combined with our CBD Daily Conditioner, your hair will have a shinier, silkier look while feeling better than ever. It’ll quickly become an essential part of your beauty routine that you didn’t know you needed.</p>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hydrates and nourishes hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Sulfate-free</li>\n<li>Good for all hair types</li>\n<li>Safe for color-treated hair</li>\n<li>Contains 10mg of CBD!</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><br></h4>","repair-me-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>RESTORATIVE, STRENGTHENING CONDITIONER FOR DRY AND BRITTLE HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Repair, renew and restore dry, damaged, frizzy over-processed hair with REPAIR.ME.RINSE, our deeply nourishing and strengthening conditioner that helps reconstruct and repair the hair. Packed with a powerhouse of ‘soft-state proteins’ and enzymes, REPAIR-ME.RINSE delivers gentle lubrication to the hair, while helping to restore and protect against future damage.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A power-packed blend of proteins and enzymes</li>\n<li>Helps nourish, restore and replenish the hair</li>\n<li>Helps hair look and feel smoother and stronger</li>\n<li>Enhances manageability and shine</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types in need of targeted repair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p>Apply to freshly washed hair and allow the hair to absorb the benefits for 1-2 minutes, follow with a refreshing rinse. For optimal repairing results, use after washing with REPAIR-ME.WASH, and as part of our 3-part system from the REPAIR regimen.</p>\n<p><em>Note:</em>  You might not need to wash your hair daily, but remember to always use REPAIR-ME.WASH and RINSE for two consecutive washes even if they are apart, and then replace both with RE.STORE for the thirdwash.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","leave-in-repair":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>NOURISHING, RESTORATIVE LEAVE-IN TREATMENT FOR DAMAGED HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Intense repair and nourishment for shiny, glossy, weightless hair with the added bonus of heat protection – all this, in one handy leave-in treatment, LEAVE-IN.REPAIR. As the name implies, you just wash, condition and leave to allow our repairing treatment to get to work repairing and restoring damage where it is needed most.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Leave-in targeted repair treatment</li>\n<li>Helps restore, replenish and repair damaged hair</li>\n<li>Helps reduce hair breakage and strengthen the hair</li>\n<li>Provides heat protection up to 200°F / 93°C</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">APPLY. ABSORB. LEAVE.<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply </span>LEAVE-IN.REPAIR<span> to damp or towel-dried hair, gently massage from root to tip. Do not rinse, leave to dry naturally or style as desired.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>","killer-waves":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>WEIGHTLESS WAVE ENHANCER FOR FINE HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>A weightless curl enhancer for fine wavy or curly hair that leaves hair feeling thicker. Infused with Baobab Seed Extract to increase shine and elasticity, this spray helps to define and separate waves while reducing frizz. Use as part of a tailored daily product routine for wavy or curly hair.</span><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhances and perfects wavy and curly hair</li>\n<li>Reduces frizz</li>\n<li>Treats while styling</li>\n<li>Does not weigh hair down</li>\n<li>Ideal for fine and damaged wavy or curly hair</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Spray onto damp, towel-dried hair prior to styling. For use as a foundation product or layered with other products as desired.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>","thick-again":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>LEAVE-IN THICKENING TREATMENT FOR THINNING HAIR <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>Hair not as thick, full and lush as you’d like? Give it a little extra oomph with THICK.AGAIN. Our leave-in thickening treatment is designed for men with fine or thinning hair, and is rich in essential ingredients that will help thicken the hair and prevent breakage. Using breakthrough eyelash thickening and lengthening technology, we’ve harnessed ingredients that will leave your hair looking thicker and fuller over time.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helps to strengthen and fortify hair from root to tip</li>\n<li>Boosts thickness for increased body and bounce</li>\n<li>Helps increase microcirculation to the scalp</li>\n<li>Offers heat protection up to 420°F / 216°C</li>\n<li>Ideal for all hair types, especially fine, ageing and thinning hair</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">PREP. SPRAY. STAY.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Prep hair with </span>STIMULATE-ME.WASH and RINSE and towel dry. Spray THICK.AGAIN evenly throughout damp or towel dried hair, concentrating on the roots and scalp. Do not rinse, dry and style as usual.</div>\n</div>","stimulate-me-rinse":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>STIMULATING AND REFRESHING CONDITIONER FOR HAIR AND SCALP <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>An invigorating conditioner for men, bursting with revitalising freshness. STIMULATE-ME.RINSE delivers a stimulating blend of Camphor Crystals, Bergamot and Black Pepper that helps soothe and cool the hair and scalp, while strengthening and nourishing the hair.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rich in body-building Amino Acids and conditioning butters</li>\n<li>Stimulates the hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Helps to strengthen and repair the hair</li>\n<li>Leaves hair looking fuller and thicker</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>APPLY. ABSORB. RINSE.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply to freshly washed hair and massage into hair and scalp for 5 to 10 minutes to fully absorb the benefits, follow with a refreshing rinse. For optimal repairing results, use after washing with </span>STIMULATE-ME.WASH, and follow with THICK.AGAIN. Can be used daily.</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>","stimulate-me-wash":"<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>STIMULATING AND REFRESHING SHAMPOO FOR HAIR AND SCALP <meta charset=\"utf-8\">BY KEVIN MURPHY</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>An invigorating daily shampoo, bursting with revitalising freshness. Created with a stimulating blend of Camphor Crystals, Bergamot and Black Pepper, STIMULATE-ME.WASH enlivens the senses, as it awakens and clarifies the hair and scalp.</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stimulates the hair and scalp</li>\n<li>Helps to strengthen and repair the hair</li>\n<li>Leaves hair feeling fuller and thicker</li>\n<li>Suitable for all hair types</li>\n<li>Sulphate, paraben and cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>USAGE:</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">WASH. RINSE. REPEAT</div>\n<div>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Apply to wet hair and massage through the hair and scalp. Rinse and repeat. Follow with </span>STIMULATE-ME.RINSE, and finish with THICK.AGAIN. Can be used daily.</div>\n</div>","captain-fawcett-sid-sottung-barberism-beard-balm":"<strong><strong>SID SOTTUNG BARBERISM</strong></strong>® <strong>BEARD BALM BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT</strong>\n<p>A timeless, elegant scent with refreshing top notes of Lime &amp; Orange, spiked by provocative Rose &amp; Galbanum rising from an earthy Cedarwood, Patchouli &amp; Musk base.<br><span>In truth this is a simply delightful alchemic concoction which is then blended with 5 base creams and exotic waxes, this handmade pomade is simply a must have addition to any gentleman’s grooming arsenal.<br></span><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>supports healthy beard growth</span></li>\n<li><span>provides long-lasting moisture to the beard and skin</span></li>\n<li><span>easy to apply</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Ideally apply to your damp or dry, clean beard. Using the back of your thumbnail extract a small portion of balm &amp; warm by rubbing in the palms of your hands. Proceed to work the balm into the length of your beard, then comb or brush through for maximum hold, resulting in a tamed well nourished beard, that is easier to both shape &amp; style.<strong><br></strong></p>","captain-fawcett-barberism-moustache-wax":"<strong><strong>BARBERISM® MOUSTACHE WAX BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br></strong></strong>Captain Fawcett’s <i>Barberism®</i> collaboration with <i>Sid Sottung</i> has produced a simply stand-out Moustache Wax. A timeless, elegant scent with refreshing top notes of Lime &amp; Orange, spiked by provocative Rose &amp; Galbanum rising from an earthy Cedarwood, Patchouli &amp; Musk base.\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>supports healthy beard growth</span></li>\n<li><span>provides long-lasting moisture to the beard and skin</span></li>\n<li><span>easy to apply</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:<br></strong>Keep moustache wax warm in either a waistcoat or trouser pocket.Use the back of your finger nail to remove a small amount of wax from the tin. Soften wax between thumb and forefinger, smooth into your moustache in an outwards &amp; upwards motion. To one’s now perky tips, add a further touch of wax in a final twisting flourish, thus ensuring a tip top finish.</p>","captain-fawcett-barberism-beard-oil":"<strong><strong>BARBERISM® BEARD OIL BY CAPTAIN FAWCETT<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></strong></strong>\n<p>Captain Fawcett’s<i>Barberism®</i>collaboration with<i>Sid Sottung</i>has produced a first-rate, deeply enriching Beard Oil in a handy travel-size perfect for the gentleman’s wash bag.<br>A timeless, elegant scent with refreshing top notes of Lime &amp; Orange, spiked by provocative Rose &amp; Galbanum rising from an earthy Cedarwood, Patchouli &amp; Musk base. Bound with Sweet Almond, Jojoba &amp; Vitamin E carrier oils, in truth this is a simply delightful alchemic concoction.<br><strong>BENEFITS:</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>facilitates easy beard combing</span></li>\n<li><span>provides a subtle fresh scent</span></li>\n<li><span>keeps the beard healthy and shiny</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>USAGE:</strong><br><span>Dispense a few drops into the palm of your hand &amp; rub together. Smooth the oil thoroughly into your beard &amp; gently comb through for a Sid Sottung finish.</span><br></p>"};
